# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:9
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b4f35adf:

    # "I open my eyes slowly."
    "Eu abro os meus olhos devagar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:12
translate ptbr carlwednesday_692e11f3:

    # "The pressure in my head tells me I didn't get nearly enough sleep."
    "A pressão na minha cabeça me diz que eu não dormi quase o suficiente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:13
translate ptbr carlwednesday_510cd94d:

    # "Not really a surprise considering we were both up until three."
    "Não é bem uma surpresa, considerando que ficamos os dois acordados até às três."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:14
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fe228929:

    # "And our own ghost adventure a few hours later didn't help things."
    "E a nossa própria aventura fantasma algumas horas depois não ajudou muito."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:16
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1638377c:

    # "I hear the doorbell and realize that that's what had woken me up."
    "Eu ouço a campainha e percebo que foi isso que me acordou."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:17
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6a3cc39b:

    # "Groaning, I reach under my pillow and feel around for a few seconds before I find my phone."
    "Gemendo, eu enfio a mão embaixo do travesseiro e tateio por alguns segundos antes de encontrar meu celular."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:18
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9a9a929f:

    # "The lump that is Carl under the blankets near my feet doesn't even budge."
    "O bolo que é o Carl debaixo das cobertas perto dos meus pés não se mexe nem um pouco."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:19
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5983beff:

    # "That was the cool thing about having Carl as a roommate; he slept like a fucking rock."
    "Essa era a coisa legal de ter o Carl como colega de quarto; ele dormia feito uma pedra, porra."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:20
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4c12d61a:

    # "I did pretty much anything I wanted to and didn't have to worry about him reporting me to the RA...even something like jerking off."
    "Eu fazia basicamente qualquer coisa que queria e não precisava me preocupar com ele me dedurando pro inspetor... até mesmo coisas como bater uma."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:21
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2480cd9f:

    # "That only happened a few times, though."
    "Embora isso só tenha acontecido algumas vezes."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:22
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6faf39dc:

    # "The rabbit I'm rooming with now is a different story."
    "O coelho que divide o quarto comigo agora é outra história."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:24
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e8c127c9:

    # "Again, the doorbell."
    "De novo, a campainha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:25
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c908970c:

    # "I glance at my phone: 10 AM"
    "Eu dou uma olhada pro meu celular: 10 da manhã"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:26
translate ptbr carlwednesday_04bae885:

    # "I also notice I have five texts and two calls."
    "Também percebo que tenho cinco mensagens e duas ligações."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:29
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:31
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ae9bcd0_1:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:33
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ae9bcd0_2:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:35
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ae9bcd0_3:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:37
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ae9bcd0_4:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:39
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9bcfb766:

    # "That sounds like the reverse of a surprise party."
    "Isso soa como o reverso de uma festa surpresa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:41
translate ptbr carlwednesday_61c8c347:

    # "I look down, then nudge some part of Carl with my foot. Judging by the thickness and consistency I'm pretty sure it's his ass."
    "Eu olho pra baixo, depois cutuco uma parte do Carl com o pé. Julgando pela espessura e consistência, tenho quase certeza de que é a bunda dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:42
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3511167b:

    # "He grunts."
    "Ele gruhne."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:43
translate ptbr carlwednesday_214c0171:

    # c "\"Mh? What?\""
    c "\"Mh? O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:44
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7bc61b7b:

    # m "\"I think someone's at the door?\""
    m "\"Eu acho que tem alguém na porta?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:45
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4716b99f:

    # "He doesn't say anything and a few seconds later his guttural snores start up again."
    "Ele não fala nada e alguns segundos depois seus roncos guturais recomeçam."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:46
translate ptbr carlwednesday_06efa48a:

    # "This time I really dig my foot in and he yelps loudly, sitting up so fast his horns bang against the wall."
    "Dessa vez eu enfio o pé com força e ele dá um grito alto, sentando tão rápido que os chifres dele batem na parede."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:47
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bb37ab69:

    # "He squints against the sunlight pouring in between the blinds which turns his emerald eyes into an almost mint green."
    "Ele aperta os olhos contra a luz do sol que entra pelas persianas, o que transforma seus olhos esmeralda num tom quase verde-menta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:48
translate ptbr carlwednesday_27577c85:

    # "He raises up a paw to block the light and looks at me, frowning."
    "Ele levanta uma pata pra bloquear a luz e olha pra mim, franzindo a testa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:49
translate ptbr carlwednesday_49de3200:

    # c "\"What the hell was that?\""
    c "\"Mas que porra foi essa?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:51
translate ptbr carlwednesday_eecdf3de:

    # "The doorbell goes off again."
    "A campainha toca de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:52
translate ptbr carlwednesday_99f937c2:

    # m "\"Door.\""
    m "\"A porta.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:53
translate ptbr carlwednesday_651055fd:

    # "Carl blinks at me, then slumps back down on his pillow, waving a paw lazily in the air."
    "O Carl pisca pra mim, depois se joga de volta no travesseiro, acenando a pata com preguiça no ar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:54
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a89959fc:

    # c "\"Let it ring. They'll go away eventually.\""
    c "\"Deixa tocar. Eles vão embora, eventualmente.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:55
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ee4861c:

    # m "\"Huh? Are you sure?\""
    m "\"Hã? Tem certeza?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:56
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2bac0eab:

    # "He flops his paw around again."
    "Ele balança a pata de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:57
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cf68fe0c:

    # c "\"Solicitor, trust me. They see this house and make a beeline. No one else visits.\""
    c "\"Vendedor, confia em mim. Eles veem essa casa e vêm direto pra cá. Ninguém mais vem visitar.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:58
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d54515ea:

    # "I sigh, looking back down at my phone."
    "Eu suspiro, olhando de volta pro meu celular."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:59
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c412d82b:

    # m "\"Oh look, Leo texted me. That's probably him at the door.\""
    m "\"Ah, olha, o Leo me mandou mensagem. Provavelmente é ele na porta.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:60
translate ptbr carlwednesday_25086be0:

    # "I guess my tone of surprise was a little too fake because Carl sits up and eyes me suspiciously."
    "Acho que meu tom de surpresa foi um pouco falso demais, porque o Carl se senta e me encara com suspeita."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:62
translate ptbr carlwednesday_83161474:

    # c "\"Well, you can go ahead and answer it. You're allowed to touch my door.\""
    c "\"Bem, você pode ir lá e atender. Você tem permissão pra tocar na minha porta.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:63
translate ptbr carlwednesday_28d74a14:

    # "I sigh a little harder this time."
    "Eu suspiro um pouco mais forte dessa vez."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:64
translate ptbr carlwednesday_17817295:

    # m "\"Damnit, Carl. Fine, they're planning a surprise birthday party for you so go down there, answer the door, and act surprised.\""
    m "\"Droga, Carl. Tá bom, eles tão planejando uma festa de aniversário surpresa pra você, então vai lá embaixo, atende a porta e finge surpresa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:66
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fb70ab3e:

    # c "\"What?\""
    c "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:67
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9d72dc4a:

    # "But Carl's not just confused, he looks genuinely upset."
    "Mas o Carl não tá só confuso, ele parece genuinamente chateado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:68
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4fdc6da6:

    # "He leans into the corner, and pulls up the blanket, like he's preparing to ward off the boogeyman."
    "Ele se encolhe no canto, e puxa a coberta, como se tivesse se preparando pra afastar o bicho-papão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:69
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2e222d58:

    # c "\"My birthday isn't until next month.\""
    c "\"Meu aniversário é só no mês que vem.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:70
translate ptbr carlwednesday_76498fb8:

    # "I pause, watching him."
    "Eu paro, observando-o."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:71
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fcf30b0a:

    # m "\"I know, but we didn't have much to do, so Leo thought...\""
    m "\"Eu sei, mas não tínhamos muito o que fazer, então o Leo pensou...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:73
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4f02c80b:

    # "I slide off the bed and start pulling on my jeans and a shirt."
    "Eu escorrego pra fora da cama e começo a vestir minha calça jeans e uma camisa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:74
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6f3123a1:

    # m "\"Come on. I'll go down with you.\""
    m "\"Vem. Eu desço com você.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:76
translate ptbr carlwednesday_53b3e3f6:

    # "Carl covers his face and rubs hard, the short fur on his muzzle bristling out in little spikes around his fingers."
    "O Carl cobre o rosto e esfrega com força, o pelo curto no focinho se arrepiando em pequenos espinhos ao redor dos dedos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:77
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c0296aff:

    # c "\"I just...wanted to relax today, you know?\""
    c "\"Eu só... queria relaxar hoje, sabe?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:78
translate ptbr carlwednesday_95a127a0:

    # m "\"Isn't that everyday for you?\""
    m "\"Isso não é o que você faz todo dia?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:80
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b4298541:

    # "I laugh to lighten the jab, but Carl just frowns."
    "Eu rio pra aliviar a alfinetada, mas o Carl só franze a testa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:81
translate ptbr carlwednesday_82064922:

    # c "\"Well, not with you.\""
    c "\"Bom, não com você.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:82
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fe2f4859:

    # "I'm starting to wonder if all of this isolation has worsened Carl's issues, if he really has gotten the help he needs."
    "Eu começo a me perguntar se todo esse isolamento não piorou os problemas do Carl, se ele realmente conseguiu a ajuda que precisa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:83
translate ptbr carlwednesday_94a3a39c:

    # "That all of this hiding out has just blanketed the problem and let it fester underneath."
    "Que todo esse lance de se esconder só encobriu o problema e deixou ele apodrecer por baixo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:84
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6235b439:

    # m "\"We can relax. We're all friends here, Carl. Come on.\""
    m "\"A gente pode relaxar. Somos todos amigos aqui, Carl. Vamos.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:85
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3db7c3d8:

    # "I pick up his clothes left on the floor from yesterday and toss them at him."
    "Eu pego as roupas dele largadas no chão desde ontem e as jogo nele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:86
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0760cb46:

    # "I'm at least relieved to see him putting them on, even if it's reluctant."
    "Fico pelo menos aliviado ao vê-lo vesti-las, mesmo que de má vontade."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:87
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8611bc5f:

    # "My phone buzzes a few more times, but I ignore it and patiently wait for Carl to finish getting dressed."
    "Meu celular vibra mais algumas vezes, mas eu ignoro e espero com paciência o Carl terminar de se vestir."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:88
translate ptbr carlwednesday_38f04190:

    # m "\"I think this'll be a lot of fun.\""
    m "\"Acho que isso vai ser muito divertido.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:89
translate ptbr carlwednesday_74cd24f4:

    # "He doesn't say anything as he slowly rolls off the bed and pulls on his shorts."
    "Ele não diz nada enquanto escorrega da cama devagar e veste as bermudas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:92
translate ptbr carlwednesday_776eb84e:

    # "Everyone" "\"Surprise!\""
    "Everyone" "\"Surpresa!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:93
translate ptbr carlwednesday_66037216:

    # f "\"Happy-not-really-your-birthday, bitch!\""
    f "\"Feliz-não-é-bem-seu-aniversário, puto!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:95
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1c3181cc:

    # "As I open the door a blast of confetti hits my face along with a loud pop that leaves my ears ringing."
    "Assim que eu abro a porta, uma explosão de confete bate na minha cara, junto de um estouro alto que deixa meus ouvidos zumbindo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:97
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c86424e4:

    # j "\"TJ, not in the face!\""
    j "\"TJ, no rosto não!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:99
translate ptbr carlwednesday_367f1f2b:

    # t "\"Sorry!\""
    t "\"Desculpa!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:100
translate ptbr carlwednesday_51af4d7b:

    # "I slowly pull the papery strings of confetti off from around my ears as the smell of fireworks stings my nose."
    "Eu tiro devagar os fios de papel de confete de trás das minhas orelhas enquanto o cheiro de fogos de artifício arde no meu nariz."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:102
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a64b1ab2:

    # f "\"Where the fuck's Carl?\""
    f "\"Onde caralhos o Carl tá?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:107
translate ptbr carlwednesday_899f63e9:

    # "I look behind me and step over to the side a bit, revealing Carl who's got his arms folded tightly, head dipped."
    "Eu olho pra trás e dou um passo pro lado um pouco, revelando o Carl que tá de braços cruzados bem apertados, cabeça baixa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:109
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a5f64c6e:

    # c "\"Good thing I didn't answer the door, huh?.\""
    c "\"Ainda bem que eu não atendi a porta, né?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:111
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d9e4ff6e:

    # l "\"Happy birthday!\""
    l "\"Feliz aniversário!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:113
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e0f28068:

    # "Leo bustles in, carrying two bags."
    "O Leo entra apressado, carregando duas sacolas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:114
translate ptbr carlwednesday_164098a6:

    # "Jenna follows, carrying medium-sized cylindrical cake covered in white frosting."
    "Jenna vem logo atrás, carregando um bolo cilíndrico de tamanho médio coberto com glacê branco."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:116
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ef3e7673:

    # "Carl perks a bit when he sees this, his long ears bouncing."
    "O Carl se anima um pouco quando vê isso, as orelhas compridas dele balançando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:117
translate ptbr carlwednesday_687fcde2:

    # c "\"Hey, is that red velvet?\""
    c "\"Ei, isso é red velvet?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:119
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9ccf8eb5:

    # j "\"Yeah. Flynn says it's your favorite. Store-made, though. I would have made it myself if LEO had warned us in advance.\""
    j "\"É. O Flynn disse que é o seu favorito. Comprado pronto, porém. Eu mesma teria feito se o LEO tivesse nos avisado com antecedência.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:120
translate ptbr carlwednesday_483eba40:

    # l "\"Hey, I just came up with this like, two days ago.\""
    l "\"Ei, eu tive essa ideia tipo, dois dias atrás.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:124
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a090d153:

    # "Flynn engages Carl with some fake punches while Leo sets the bags down on the table before turning to me with his voice low."
    "O Flynn começa a dar uns socos de brincadeira no Carl enquanto o Leo coloca as sacolas na mesa antes de se virar pra mim com a voz baixa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:125
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0f5d3f9a:

    # l "\"Just so you know, your gift is a horn band.\""
    l "\"Só pra você saber, o seu presente é uma faixa de chifre.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:126
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f3eddd7c:

    # m "\"Okay.. so is everything alright? With Flynn, I mean.\""
    m "\"Beleza... então tá tudo bem? Com o Flynn, eu digo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:128
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c277ec34:

    # "Leo glances over at the lizard, quirking the corner of his mouth up towards his ear."
    "O Leo dá uma olhada pro lagarto, puxando o canto da boca em direção à orelha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:129
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8388808d:

    # l "\"Yeah—yeah, I think so.\""
    l "\"É—é, acho que sim.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:130
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5f86e410:

    # l "\"It will take a bit of time for him to settle down, but he already sorta apologized while you were gone..\""
    l "\"Vai levar um tempinho pra ele se acalmar, mas ele já meio que pediu desculpas enquanto você tava fora..\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:131
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a2d2b002:

    # l "\"..so that's a start at least, yeah?\""
    l "\"..então pelo menos é um começo, né?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:132
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ebad492e:

    # "I exhale."
    "Eu solto o ar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:133
translate ptbr carlwednesday_79b5f6bb:

    # m "\"...Okay.\""
    m "\"...Beleza.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:134
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b785c4cd:

    # j "\"Carl, where are your plates?\""
    j "\"Carl, onde tão os seus pratos?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:136
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9580dbc9:

    # c "\"The uh—the cupboard, second door over.\""
    c "\"O hum—o armário, segunda porta ao lado.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:137
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8101f876:

    # "Now that Flynn's not shoving him around Carl's standing awkwardly next to the table, paws fidgeting."
    "Agora que o Flynn parou de empurrar ele, o Carl fica meio desajeitado do lado da mesa, mexendo nas patas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:138
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3514760d:

    # c "\"Sooo why are we doing this? It's not until next month.\""
    c "\"Eentãão por que a gente tá fazendo isso? É só no mês que vem.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:140
translate ptbr carlwednesday_54a2d3ca:

    # "Leo shrugs, frowning."
    "O Leo dá de ombros, franzindo a testa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:141
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3f8735d6:

    # l "\"We just wanted to do something, really. I mean, there's not much to do, ya know?\""
    l "\"A gente só queria fazer alguma coisa, na real. Quer dizer, não tem muito o que fazer, sabe?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:142
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cb968be4:

    # j "\"You have candles anywhere, Carl?\""
    j "\"Você tem velas em algum lugar, Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:143
translate ptbr carlwednesday_11ae04ad:

    # c "\"Uh, no—no I don't think so.\""
    c "\"Uh, não—não, eu acho que não.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:145
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5ce16738:

    # f "\"What's up man. Haven't had your morning joint, yet? Lighten up!\""
    f "\"Qual foi, cara. Não fumou o seu baseado matinal, ainda? Relaxa!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:146
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5c358a85:

    # "Flynn snatches up one of Carl's horns and wobbles his head around."
    "O Flynn agarra um dos chifres do Carl e balança a cabeça dele pros lados."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:147
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d8e2eb02:

    # "While it's something Flynn did to Carl a lot, the taboo act of grabbing someone's horn almost makes me gasp out loud."
    "Embora seja algo que o Flynn fizesse com o Carl com frequência, o ato tabu de agarrar o chifre de alguém quase me faz arfar de tão surpreso."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:148
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7bedd9c2:

    # c "\"Sssstop...\""
    c "\"Paaara...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:149
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a8afc901:

    # "Carl shoves Flynn off and smooths his beanie down."
    "O Carl empurra o Flynn e ajeita a touca."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:150
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ece0fb9d:

    # j "\"Well, I guess we'll have to skip the candles. I told you we should have bought some, Leo.\""
    j "\"Bem, eu acho que vamos ter que pular as velas. Eu falei que a gente devia ter comprado algumas, Leo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:153
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3a1e9bd6:

    # "Leo throws his arms out in a shrug."
    "O Leo abre os braços numa de dar de ombros."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:154
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8bcc7997:

    # l "\"What? Sue me if I thought they'd have everything we'd need in this mansion.\""
    l "\"O quê? Me processa se eu achei que eles teriam tudo o que a gente precisasse nessa mansão.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:157
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c8bbebff:

    # t "\"No kidding. You know how places you haven't been to since you were little look smaller when you visit as an adult?\""
    t "\"Não brinca. Sabe como lugares que você não vai desde criança parecem menores quando você visita de adulto?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:159
translate ptbr carlwednesday_10a4e725:

    # "TJ's eyes scan the tall ceiling."
    "Os olhos do TJ varrem o teto alto."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:160
translate ptbr carlwednesday_570fb078:

    # t "\"This place still just looks giant, haha.\""
    t "\"Esse lugar ainda parece gigante, haha.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:161
translate ptbr carlwednesday_af443077:

    # c "\"Sure Teej.\""
    c "\"É, Teej.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:162
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7fd96a8a:

    # "Carl huffs out a breath."
    "O Carl suspira."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:163
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cf87e3d1:

    # c "\"Why didn't you guys tell me? I still need to take a shower...\""
    c "\"Por que vocês não me falaram? Eu ainda preciso tomar banho...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:164
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1a7f7980:

    # f "\"Quit being a pussy. You always smell like skunk. Now eat some cake!\""
    f "\"Para de frescura. Você sempre tem cheiro de gambá. Agora come o bolo!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:166
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3fc2ae79:

    # "Flynn grabs up the knife while Jenna sets out the plates. The frosting is so thick it practically absorbs the knife."
    "O Flynn pega a faca enquanto a Jenna distribui os pratos. A cobertura é tão grossa que praticamente absorve a faca."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:167
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0465d70d:

    # m "\"I haven't had cake for breakfast since like, your last birthday party, Carl.\""
    m "\"Eu não comia bolo no café da manhã desde tipo, a sua última festa de aniversário, Carl.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:168
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7d72d793:

    # "Carl doesn't say anything, instead sitting at the end of the table, paws in his pockets."
    "O Carl não diz nada, se sentando na ponta da mesa, com as patas nos bolsos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:170
translate ptbr carlwednesday_110e4c93:

    # l "\"You guys sure slept in. What were you doing all night?\""
    l "\"Vocês com certeza dormiram até tarde. O que tavam fazendo a noite toda?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:171
translate ptbr carlwednesday_43c82d16:

    # "I wait to see if Carl is going to say anything. When it's clear he isn't I chime in."
    "Eu espero pra ver se o Carl vai falar alguma coisa. Quando fica claro que ele não vai, eu me intrometo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:172
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4e7fb02b:

    # m "\"Video games, mostly, and a movie.\""
    m "\"Videogames, na maioria, e um filme.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:173
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ccb112ad:

    # l "\"Fun, fun. It's something we could have all done together, though.\""
    l "\"Divertido, divertido. Mas é algo que poderíamos ter feito todos juntos.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:175
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1fa2de7b:

    # f "\"Maybe for people who don't have a job to go to the next day.\""
    f "\"Talvez pra quem não tem um emprego pra ir no dia seguinte.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:176
translate ptbr carlwednesday_311470e1:

    # "I don't think that was a personal dig at Carl, but I don't miss the downward flick of his ears."
    "Eu não acho que isso foi uma indireta pro Carl, mas eu não deixo de notar o movimento rápido das orelhas dele pra baixo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:177
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0b6e324a:

    # "Flynn plops down a thick slice of cake onto Carl's plate, the inch-deep frosting making a splatting sound."
    "O Flynn joga uma fatia grossa de bolo no prato do Carl, a cobertura de centímetros de espessura fazendo um som de 'splat'."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:178
translate ptbr carlwednesday_edef6045:

    # f "\"Heh, maybe we should just stick a doobie in there and light it, huh?\""
    f "\"Heh, talvez a gente deva colocar um baseado aí e acender, hã?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:180
translate ptbr carlwednesday_612bc102:

    # "Carl, who had perked up at the sight of the cake, shrinks back down with a frown."
    "Carl, que tinha se animado com a visão do bolo, se encolhe com uma carranca."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:182
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0bcefe2e:

    # t "\"Just a small slice, please.\""
    t "\"Só um pedacinho, por favor.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:183
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d7600f10:

    # "Flynn eyes TJ who's holding out his plate and positions the knife."
    "O Flynn observa o TJ que tá estendendo o prato e posiciona a faca."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:184
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8c534244:

    # t "\"Smaller...please.\""
    t "\"Menor... por favor.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:185
translate ptbr carlwednesday_41c96430:

    # f "\"Oh my God, loosen up. You're on vacation!\""
    f "\"Aí meu Deus, relaxa. Você tá de férias!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:186
translate ptbr carlwednesday_27e5e712:

    # "Flynn starts cutting the slice even bigger than Carl's was."
    "O Flynn começa a cortar a fatia ainda maior que a do Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:188
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f1977462:

    # t "\"Hey!\""
    t "\"Ei!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:190
translate ptbr carlwednesday_281a28d9:

    # j "\"Flynn.\""
    j "\"Flynn.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:194
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d7826da5:

    # "She says it quietly but the chill in her voice is clear, and so is the fact that things aren't completely okay."
    "Ela diz baixinho, mas o tom frio na voz dela é claro, assim como o fato de que as coisas não estão completamente bem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:195
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c4be75cf:

    # "Flynn grunts, then cuts the cake again, this time with a slice that's just an inch wide."
    "O Flynn grunhe, depois corta o bolo de novo, dessa vez com uma fatia de poucos centímetros."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:196
translate ptbr carlwednesday_84cf7525:

    # f "\"That good?\""
    f "\"Tá bom assim?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:197
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6cf7472b:

    # t "\"Yeah, that's fine...thanks.\""
    t "\"É, tá ótimo... valeu.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:199
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4bd65a98:

    # "TJ moves away to sit down and the warm glow of our little get together chills, but Leo chips in with a laugh."
    "O TJ se afasta pra se sentar e o brilho acolhedor da nossa pequena reunião esfria, mas o Leo entra na conversa com uma risada."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:201
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8e7ef975:

    # l "\"Make sure Chase gets a real big chunk. He's getting waaay too skinny.\""
    l "\"Vê se dá um pedaço bem grande pro Chase. Ele tá ficaaaando muito magrelo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:202
translate ptbr carlwednesday_441bc03c:

    # "I don't argue and Flynn slaps down a large slice on my plate, a little notch in the center where he'd tried to cut TJ's."
    "Eu não discuto e o Flynn joga uma fatia enorme no meu prato, com um pequeno entalhe no meio onde ele tentou cortar a do TJ."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:208
translate ptbr carlwednesday_459d240c:

    # "I sit in the vacant seat next to Carl where he's resting a cheek in his paw, methodically shoveling the cake into his maw."
    "Eu sento no lugar vazio ao lado do Carl, onde ele tá apoiando a bochecha na pata, enfiando metodicamente o bolo na boca."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:209
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c62489e9:

    # m "\"Everything okay?\""
    m "\"Tudo bem?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:211
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ff8138c3:

    # c "\"Hm? Oh yeah, yeah everything's good.\""
    c "\"Hm? Ah, sim, sim, tá tudo de boa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:213
translate ptbr carlwednesday_27890bec:

    # "I'm about to ask more, but Flynn points across the table at us."
    "Eu tô prestes a perguntar mais, mas o Flynn aponta pra gente do outro lado da mesa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:215
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6aac8fcb:

    # f "\"Hey, Leo. Wanna tell them about what we saw on the way here?\""
    f "\"Ei, Leo. Quer contar pra eles o que a gente viu a caminho daqui?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:216
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b109cfb2:

    # j "\"Oh God, no...\""
    j "\"Ai, meu Deus, não...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:217
translate ptbr carlwednesday_45526e8a:

    # "I look at Leo inquisitively and even Carl's ears perk up a little bit."
    "Eu olho pro Leo com curiosidade e até as orelhas do Carl se levantam um pouco."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:218
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:219
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9f83c4da:

    # "Leo purses his lips, like he's trying to decide whether or not to tell us."
    "O Leo aperta os lábios, como se tivesse tentando decidir se conta pra gente ou não."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:220
translate ptbr carlwednesday_61f1249d:

    # l "\"Now might not be the best time.\""
    l "\"Agora talvez não seja a melhor hora.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:221
translate ptbr carlwednesday_52ac21e7:

    # "Flynn rolls his eyes."
    "O Flynn revira os olhos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:223
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bbdab879:

    # f "\"Screw it. You know Janice?\""
    f "\"Foda-se. Sabe a Janice?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:224
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b5ab3950:

    # m "\"The waitress?\""
    m "\"A garçonete?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:225
translate ptbr carlwednesday_74a235c9:

    # f "\"Yeah, the methed out one at the diner.\""
    f "\"É, a viciada em metanfetamina da lanchonete.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:226
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ef99dd08:

    # l "\"Come on, Flynn.\""
    l "\"Qual é, Flynn.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:227
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2945a0d8:

    # f "\"Well anyway, we were drivin' up Main Street, toward the field, you know, with rusted barbed wire and stuff?\""
    f "\"Bem, de qualquer forma, a gente tava subindo a rua principal, em direção ao campo, sabe, com os arames farpados enferrujados e tals?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:228
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7382633f:

    # "TJ's hiding his face with a paw as he stares down hard at his cake."
    "O TJ esconde o rosto com a pata enquanto encara fixamente o próprio bolo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:229
translate ptbr carlwednesday_49dbe948:

    # m "\"Uh—huh.\""
    m "\"Aham.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:230
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f0a2c6aa:

    # f "\"Well, when we turned 'round the bend we saw Janice.\""
    f "\"Bem, quando a gente virou a curva, a gente viu a Janice.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:231
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0d9e0d46:

    # "He keeps pausing for effect and it's getting annoying."
    "Ele continua fazendo pausas pra dar efeito e tá ficando irritante."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:232
translate ptbr carlwednesday_806bc677:

    # m "\"Okay, what happened?\""
    m "\"Tá, o que aconteceu?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:233
translate ptbr carlwednesday_04e29884:

    # f "\"Well, she was all crouched over, starin' at the road and Leo starts drivin' up to her.\""
    f "\"Bem, ela tava toda agachada, encarando a rua, e o Leo começa a dirigir até ela.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:234
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d5c410e0:

    # l "\"I thought she was having like, a heart attack, or something.\""
    l "\"Eu achei que ela tava tendo tipo, um ataque cardíaco, ou algo assim.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:235
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b595518f:

    # f "\"Yeah, well, as we get closer, we saw that her pants were down...\""
    f "\"É, bem, assim que chegamos mais perto, a gente viu que as calças dela tavam abaixadas...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:236
translate ptbr carlwednesday_19de7b66:

    # "I recoil a little, not having expected that at all."
    "Eu recuo um pouco, sem esperar por isso de jeito nenhum."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:237
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:238
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7a8472fb:

    # f "\"Yeah, and when we pulled up next to her she just grinned at us and then...\""
    f "\"É, e quando a gente encostou do lado dela, ela só sorriu pra gente e então...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:239
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7e85ca4d:

    # "Flynn snorts out a laugh, covering his face, like he still can't believe what happened."
    "O Flynn dá uma risada anasalada, cobrindo o rosto, como se ele ainda não conseguisse acreditar no que aconteceu."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:240
translate ptbr carlwednesday_516580ef:

    # t "\"Can we please not talk about this? It just makes me feel awful.\""
    t "\"Podemos por favor não falar sobre isso? Só me faz me sentir mal.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:241
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df8ec4bc_2:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:243
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ace21344:

    # f "\"Well, uh—she, uh—\""
    f "\"Bem, hum—ela, hum—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:244
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9f1a1d28:

    # "It's unusual to see Flynn at a loss for words."
    "É incomum ver o Flynn sem palavras."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:245
translate ptbr carlwednesday_10e85710:

    # f "\"Well, she just started pissin'.\""
    f "\"Bem, ela só começou a mijar.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:246
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ac52d5cd:

    # m "\"Wha—what? Why?\""
    m "\"O—o quê? Por quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:247
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ba152de2:

    # f "\"I dunno! She just smiled at us and started pissin'. Heard it first, then looked down and saw it. Then Leo hit the gas.\""
    f "\"Eu não sei! Ela só sorriu pra gente e começou a mijar. Ouvi primeiro, depois olhei pra baixo e vi. Aí o Leo pisou no acelerador.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:249
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9bce5708:

    # "Flynn sits back, done with his story, not exactly looking pleased with himself."
    "O Flynn se recosta, tendo terminado a sua história, não parecendo exatamente muito orgulhoso de si mesmo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:251
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3a81a7a4:

    # "I furrow my brow in confusion."
    "Eu franzo a testa, confuso."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:252
translate ptbr carlwednesday_af489190:

    # "Janice? She was one of the more well-adjusted people living in this town."
    "Janice? Ela era uma das pessoas mais bem resolvidas que viviam nessa cidade."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:253
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f4bc1eb9:

    # "Leo lets out a cough into the awkward silence."
    "O Leo solta uma tosse no meio do silêncio constrangedor."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:254
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4fe707e2:

    # l "\"I'm still trying to figure out what exactly happened, like maybe we missed something? Either way she seemed fine a few days ago...\""
    l "\"Eu ainda tô tentando entender o que exatamente aconteceu, tipo, talvez a gente tenha perdido alguma coisa? De qualquer jeito, ela parecia bem há uns dias...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:255
translate ptbr carlwednesday_af7e47cd:

    # f "\"Well, now I have more reason to never go into that diner again.\""
    f "\"Bom, agora eu tenho mais motivo pra nunca mais pisar naquela lanchonete.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:256
translate ptbr carlwednesday_00ba8a2f:

    # "We sit there, awkwardly. I notice Carl is still staring down at his now-empty plate."
    "Ficamos sentados ali, num silêncio constrangedor. Noto que o Carl ainda tá encarando o seu prato, agora vazio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:260
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b3e30f6:

    # "I still can't figure out why Carl's being so quiet, but I see an opportunity to get him to talk..."
    "Eu ainda não consigo entender por que o Carl tá tão quieto, mas eu vejo uma oportunidade pra fazer ele falar..."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:261
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2e08c18e:

    # "AND change the subject."
    "E mudar de assunto."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:262
translate ptbr carlwednesday_82ea814a:

    # m "\"Hey, didn't we have some weird stuff happen, Carl?\""
    m "\"Ei, não aconteceram umas paradas estranhas com a gente, Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:264
translate ptbr carlwednesday_50bdbc1b:

    # "Carl looks up at me."
    "O Carl olha pra mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:265
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f62c423b:

    # c "\"Huh?\""
    c "\"Hã?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:266
translate ptbr carlwednesday_556ab579:

    # m "\"You know, the sounds we were hearing?\""
    m "\"Sabe, os sons que a gente tava ouvindo?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:267
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b779a98:

    # c "\"Oh...yeah.\""
    c "\"Ah... é.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:269
translate ptbr carlwednesday_087bf474:

    # f "\"What kind of sounds?\""
    f "\"Que tipo de sons?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:270
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4b5e374c:

    # m "\"Like bumping sounds, and voices.\""
    m "\"Como sons de batida, e vozes.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:272
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b396b42f:

    # t "\"That sounds creepy.\""
    t "\"Isso soa assustador.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:273
translate ptbr carlwednesday_82097e13:

    # m "\"Yeah, and Carl just charged down there, like he wasn't even scared.\""
    m "\"Pois é, e o Carl simplesmente desceu correndo pra lá, como se não estivesse nem um pouco assustado.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:274
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ec5c9112:

    # t "\"That seems dangerous.\""
    t "\"Isso parece perigoso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:276
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6da7717d:

    # "Carl finally gives a little smile."
    "O Carl finalmente dá um sorrisinho."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:277
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e86a5b23:

    # c "\"Heh, well, having a hard head can make you act crazy sometimes.\""
    c "\"Heh, bom, ter a cabeça dura pode te fazer agir feito louco às vezes.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:278
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7ce1995b:

    # f "\"Sooo, did you find anything?\""
    f "\"Entãão, vocês acharam alguma coisa?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:279
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ed4c997:

    # m "\"No, we're not sure what it was.\""
    m "\"Não, não temos certeza do que foi.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:280
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0024fddd:

    # f "\"I'd watch out. Sounds like ya got a pair of hobos bangin' out in your basement.\""
    f "\"Eu tomaria cuidado. Parece que tem uma dupla de mendigos transando no porão de vocês.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:286
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ffd6e339:

    # "As we eat Jenna leans over and starts pulling out presents from one of the bags."
    "Enquanto comemos, a Jenna se inclina e começa a tirar presentes de uma das sacolas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:288
translate ptbr carlwednesday_42677e19:

    # j "\"Sorry, Carl, We didn't even have time to wrap these up.\""
    j "\"Desculpa, Carl. A gente não teve nem tempo pra embrulhar esses presentes.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:289
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f4126427:

    # c "\"It's fine.\""
    c "\"Tudo bem.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:290
translate ptbr carlwednesday_37eba356:

    # "She pulls out a comic book from TJ, a poster from Leo, and a manga from herself."
    "Ela tira uma história em quadrinhos do TJ, um pôster do Leo e um mangá dela mesma."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:291
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bb0726f0:

    # j "\"I know you hate these things, but I think you should give it a chance.\""
    j "\"Eu sei que você odeia essas coisas, mas eu acho que você devia dar uma chance.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:292
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5e109b2f:

    # c "\"I'll take a look. Thanks...\""
    c "\"Eu vou dar uma olhada. Valeu...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:293
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5caaabff:

    # j "\"And then this horn band from Chase.\""
    j "\"E por último, essa faixa de chifre do Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:294
translate ptbr carlwednesday_913ba2f3:

    # "She pulls out an orange and black band from the bag."
    "Ela tira uma faixa laranja e preta da sacola."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:295
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ac935525:

    # "The colors of my school...Carl's former school."
    "As cores da minha faculdade... a antiga faculdade do Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:297
translate ptbr carlwednesday_44045982:

    # c "\"Oh...\""
    c "\"Ah...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:298
translate ptbr carlwednesday_aa688fe8:

    # "He seems to be struggling to find something to say."
    "Ele parece estar com dificuldade de achar algo pra dizer."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:299
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a3e1aca6:

    # c "\"Th-thanks. I didn't know people still wore these.\""
    c "\"V-valeu. Eu não sabia que o pessoal ainda usava isso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:300
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8c071588:

    # "Leo suddenly shifts against the counter, realizing that he had to explain \"my\" present."
    "De repente, o Leo se mexe no balcão, percebendo que ele tinha que explicar o \"meu\" presente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:301
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2cf82e51:

    # l "\"Well, they're making a comeback! We saw a couple rams and then a stag that had like, five of them on.\""
    l "\"Bom, tão voltando à moda! A gente viu uns carneiros e depois um veado que tava usando tipo, cinco dessas.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:302
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f5ccdf78:

    # "Carl glances at me, and I can tell he probably knows I didn't get it for him."
    "O Carl olha pra mim, e dá pra ver que ele provavelmente sabe que não fui eu que comprei."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:303
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fd281e0e:

    # "Mainly because of the university logo and also because we'd made fun of them together a few years ago about how \"bro-y\" they were."
    "Mais pelo logotipo da faculdade, e também porque a gente tinha zoado isso juntos há uns anos por ser coisa de \"heterotop\"."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:304
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ca8ce668:

    # "I don't know if I should feel embarrassed or not, but my cheeks burn anyway."
    "Eu não sei se devia ficar com vergonha ou não, mas minhas bochechas queimam do mesmo jeito."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:305
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cce96554:

    # "I promise myself to get him something thoughtful the next time we go into Payton."
    "Eu prometo pra mim mesmo que vou comprar algo atencioso pra ele da próxima vez que formos a Payton."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:307
translate ptbr carlwednesday_046b66cb:

    # f "\"Yeah well, here's mine.\""
    f "\"Pois é, bem, aqui tá o meu.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:308
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ae70df98:

    # "Flynn reaches into his pocket and pulls out something small, hidden in his paw."
    "O Flynn enfia a mão no bolso e tira algo pequeno, escondido na pata."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:309
translate ptbr carlwednesday_659356a2:

    # "He hands it to Carl, who looks confused for a second before the expression turns to one of interest."
    "Ele entrega pro Carl, que parece confuso por um segundo antes da expressão mudar pra uma de interesse."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:311
translate ptbr carlwednesday_70507e6e:

    # c "\"Wow.\""
    c "\"Uau.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:312
translate ptbr carlwednesday_70d79ac6:

    # "It's a small, metal, rectangular box with two sharp points jutting out the top."
    "É uma caixa pequena, de metal e retangular, com duas pontas afiadas saindo do topo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:313
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4c52a836:

    # "I lean in for a closer look and realize those parts are horns and there's a complex, elegant design of a ram's face etched out on the front of the box."
    "Eu me inclino pra dar uma olhada melhor e percebo que essas partes são chifres, e que tem um design complexo e elegante de um rosto de carneiro gravado na frente da caixa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:315
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c6837bde:

    # "Carl presses a thumb against one of the horns and pushes. The top flicks up and over and that's when I realize it's a lighter."
    "O Carl pressiona o polegar contra um dos chifres e empurra. A parte de cima se abre, e é aí que eu percebo que é um isqueiro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:316
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c376eaed:

    # f "\"Saw it when I was over on the reservation. Made me think of you.\""
    f "\"Vi quando eu tava na reserva. Me fez lembrar de você.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:318
translate ptbr carlwednesday_86bafef9:

    # "He reaches out and traces a finger along the horns and clicks it back shut."
    "Ele estende a mão e traça um dedo ao longo dos chifres, e o fecha com um clique."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:319
translate ptbr carlwednesday_61d41a6e:

    # c "\"Thanks Flynn.\""
    c "\"Valeu, Flynn.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:320
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a18f05c8:

    # f "\"Yeah, now you'll look like a badass when you decide to get blazed.\""
    f "\"É, agora você vai parecer um fodão quando decidir fumar um.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:322
translate ptbr carlwednesday_85118972:

    # c "\"Yeah...\""
    c "\"É...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:328
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6261cf0c:

    # t "\"Oh! Sorry!\""
    t "\"Ah! Desculpa!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:334
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c8007143:

    # "We all jump and look over at TJ who's looking at the floor, his plate gone form the table."
    "Nós todos damos um pulo e olhamos pro TJ, que tá olhando pro chão, seu prato sumiu da mesa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:335
translate ptbr carlwednesday_963a7d14:

    # "Flynn starts to laugh, but catches himself."
    "O Flynn começa a rir, mas se segura."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:337
translate ptbr carlwednesday_90bb103a:

    # j "\"Don't worry about it, they've probably got a hundred of those plates. Carl, where's your broom?\""
    j "\"Não esquenta com isso, eles provavelmente têm cem desses pratos. Carl, onde tá a sua vassoura?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:338
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d80764e5:

    # "He doesn't say anything and we look at where Carl had been sitting a few seconds before, but he's gone and so is another portion of the cake."
    "Ele não diz nada e a gente olha pra onde o Carl tava sentado há alguns segundos, mas ele sumiu e também outra porção do bolo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:340
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ef0b22c7:

    # j "\"Huh, where'd he go?\""
    j "\"Hã, onde ele foi?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:342
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5722b42d:

    # l "\"Hey, check between the wall and the fridge, I think that's where I remember seeing it.\""
    l "\"Ei, olha entre a parede e a geladeira, acho que é lá que eu lembro de ter visto.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:344
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1275d847:

    # "TJ gets down on his knees and starts picking up the larger pieces."
    "O TJ se ajoelha e começa a pegar os pedaços maiores."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:345
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ef44e84f:

    # "I look back at Carl's spot, then up the stairs."
    "Eu olho de volta pro lugar do Carl, depois pras escadas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:347
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ea30f0f1:

    # m "\"I'll be right back; bathroom.\""
    m "\"Já volto; banheiro.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:349
translate ptbr carlwednesday_50770ca0:

    # "I'm not sure why the deck is the first place I look, but it's where I find him."
    "Eu não tenho certeza do porquê o deck é o primeiro lugar que eu olho, mas é lá que eu o encontro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:350
translate ptbr carlwednesday_80211db4:

    # "I watch him through the paneled curtains for a moment. He's sitting on a little swing set, facing out towards the glaringly bright desert."
    "Eu o observo pelas cortinas de painel por um momento. Ele tá sentado num pequeno balanço, de frente pro deserto claro e brilhante."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:351
translate ptbr carlwednesday_00871fc8:

    # "There's an empty plate with a fork on it next to him."
    "Tem um prato vazio com um garfo nele do lado dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:352
translate ptbr carlwednesday_de915ff2:

    # "He's also toying with the lighter Flynn gave him, flipping it open and closed a few times and holding it up to the light."
    "Ele também tá brincando com o isqueiro que o Flynn deu pra ele, abrindo e fechando algumas vezes e segurando-o contra a luz."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:353
translate ptbr carlwednesday_81cd8246:

    # "Smoke wafts up from his lap where I assume he's holding a joint."
    "A fumaça sobe do colo dele, onde imagino que ele esteja segurando um baseado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:356
translate ptbr carlwednesday_104a1d5d:

    # "Quietly, I slide open the glass door and step out onto the wooden balcony."
    "Em silêncio, eu abro a porta de vidro de correr e saio pra varanda de madeira."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:357
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b83c355b:

    # "The deck is, of course, nice and big, stretching around half the house."
    "O deck é, é claro, bonito e grande, se estendendo ao redor de metade da casa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:358
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ac29efeb:

    # "I see Carl's long ears twitch at the sound and he lowers the lighter down into his lap, but doesn't turn around."
    "Vejo as longas orelhas do Carl se contraírem com o som e ele abaixa o isqueiro no colo, mas não se vira."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:359
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2cd5ad3b:

    # m "\"Hey.\""
    m "\"Oi.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:360
translate ptbr carlwednesday_51f26cec:

    # "He does turn around, then, and smiles."
    "Aí ele se vira, e sorri."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:363
translate ptbr carlwednesday_39682197:

    # c "\"Shiiit, I thought you were Leo or somethin'.\""
    c "\"Meeerda, eu achei que fosse o Leo ou sei lá.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:364
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f39aee30:

    # m "\"Would that have been a bad thing?\""
    m "\"Isso teria sido ruim?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:365
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ca76e195:

    # "I look around then just decide to sit next to him on the swing."
    "Eu olho ao redor e decido apenas sentar do lado dele no balanço."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:366
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d5830b33:

    # c "\"He'd just have pulled me back to the party.\""
    c "\"Ele só teria me puxado de volta pra festa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:367
translate ptbr carlwednesday_845e65b7:

    # "I look over at him."
    "Eu olho pra ele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:368
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a1bf85d4:

    # "He's looking down at his lighter, turning it over in his paws, the hoof portions of his fingers making clacking sounds against the metal."
    "Ele tá olhando pro isqueiro, virando ele nas patas, as partes de casco dos dedos fazendo sons de cliques contra o metal."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:369
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3ed42847:

    # "Those things always fascinated me. It seemed like it should make holding things more difficult, but he managed just fine."
    "Essas coisas sempre me fascinaram. Parecia que devia dificultar na hora de segurar as coisas, mas ele se virava muito bem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:370
translate ptbr carlwednesday_994f6c7b:

    # m "\"Are you okay?\""
    m "\"Você tá bem?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:371
translate ptbr carlwednesday_628a1a42:

    # "Carl huffs out a chuckle and leans his head back against the cushioned backing of the seat."
    "Carl solta uma risadinha e encosta a cabeça na parte almofadada do assento."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:373
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bae8fb3e:

    # c "\"That's a great question. Everyone's always asking me.\""
    c "\"Essa é uma ótima pergunta. Todo mundo sempre me pergunta isso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:374
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2f483466:

    # m "\"You just seemed really uptight, is all.\""
    m "\"Você só parecia muito tenso, é só isso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:375
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b5da0dcd:

    # "Carl's demeanor is a lot more relaxed now, obviously."
    "A postura do Carl tá muito mais relaxada agora, obviamente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:376
translate ptbr carlwednesday_207ecbd4:

    # "As if to emphasize that thought he takes another hit off his joint and holds his breath for a moment, then lets it out."
    "Como se pra enfatizar esse pensamento, ele dá mais um trago no baseado e prende a respiração por um momento, depois solta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:377
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1d26908e:

    # "The pungent smell envelopes me."
    "O cheiro forte me envolve."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:378
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8b86fe1a:

    # c "\"I just don't like being around so many people. You know that.\""
    c "\"Eu só não gosto de estar perto de tanta gente. Você sabe disso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:379
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9264d72b:

    # m "\"Well yeah, but you were fine around them these past few days.\""
    m "\"Pois é, mas você tava de boa perto deles nesses últimos dias.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:380
translate ptbr carlwednesday_97ca3720:

    # "Carl rubs his forehead hard with the paw holding the joint, using his palm."
    "Carl esfrega a testa com força com a pata segurando o baseado, usando a palma da mão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:381
translate ptbr carlwednesday_77a024eb:

    # c "\"Yeah, well, things weren't about me, then. Just felt a little bit put on the spot.\""
    c "\"É, bom, as coisas não eram sobre mim, então. Só me senti um pouco pressionado.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:382
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6e5a68b1:

    # "He coughs."
    "Ele tosse."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:383
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5c8eeb5b:

    # c "\"That shit just gets me nervous. Like, can't we just hang out and not make it about me?\""
    c "\"Essa porra só me deixa nervoso. Tipo, a gente não pode só passar um tempo juntos sem que seja sobre mim?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:384
translate ptbr carlwednesday_33ded0a4:

    # "I don't say anything, annoyed again that I just can't grasp what he means."
    "Eu não digo nada, incomodado de novo por não conseguir entender o que ele quer dizer."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:385
translate ptbr carlwednesday_aa127467:

    # m "\"Am I making you nervous?\""
    m "\"Eu tô te deixando nervoso?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:387
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c2379a18:

    # "Carl finally does look at me, then, his massive horns swaying towards me."
    "Carl finalmente olha pra mim, então, seus chifres maciços balançando na minha direção."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:388
translate ptbr carlwednesday_35734289:

    # c "\"No. You never do, Chase.\""
    c "\"Não. Você nunca deixa, Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:389
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3375ede6:

    # "I do look away at that point, almost feeling self-conscious at the way he opened up to me."
    "Eu desvio o olhar nesse momento, quase me sentindo constrangido com o jeito que ele se abriu comigo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:390
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2d96937b:

    # c "\"And thanks for trying to get me to talk earlier.\""
    c "\"E valeu por tentar me fazer falar mais cedo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:391
translate ptbr carlwednesday_366ee2fb:

    # c "\"Just makes me feel guilty, though, the way people try and include me in things and then I just disappoint them.\""
    c "\"Só me faz me sentir culpado, no entanto, o jeito que as pessoas tentam me incluir nas coisas e aí eu só as decepciono.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:392
translate ptbr carlwednesday_36a27e26:

    # c "\"But you just...don't really force me into shit. Everyone feels like I need to do something.\""
    c "\"Mas você só... não me força a porra nenhuma. Todo mundo sente que eu preciso fazer alguma coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:393
translate ptbr carlwednesday_76dc32f7:

    # c "\"Why can't I just decide that for myself?\""
    c "\"Por que eu não posso decidir isso por mim mesmo?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:394
translate ptbr carlwednesday_00260fac:

    # "I push against the ground, making the swing sway a little, trying to think of the right thing to say."
    "Eu empurro o chão, fazendo o balanço balançar um pouco, tentando pensar na coisa certa pra dizer."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:395
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ce611882:

    # m "\"I mean, it's good to do stuff, right? You can't just sit around doing nothing forever.\""
    m "\"Digo, é bom fazer as coisas, né? Você não pode só ficar sentado sem fazer nada pra sempre.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:396
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a882bf91:

    # c "\"I guess...It's just that I worry enough about it myself. I don't need other people doing it for me.\""
    c "\"Acho que sim... É que eu já me preocupo o suficiente com isso. Eu não preciso que outras pessoas façam isso por mim.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:397
translate ptbr carlwednesday_97f76289:

    # "I lean back in the swing for a bit, looking out over the desert."
    "Eu me encosto no balanço um pouco, olhando pro deserto."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:398
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4769f8a4:

    # c "\"Man, I'm hungry. Wish I'd brought more cake with me.\""
    c "\"Cara, eu tô com fome. Queria ter trazido mais bolo comigo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:399
translate ptbr carlwednesday_42922557:

    # m "\"Not enough incentive to go back in?\""
    m "\"Não é incentivo o suficiente pra voltar lá pra dentro?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:400
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c683b7c7:

    # c "\"Not yet.\""
    c "\"Ainda não.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:401
translate ptbr carlwednesday_00fd05e8:

    # m "\"I could go get you some.\""
    m "\"Eu posso ir pegar um pouco pra você.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:403
translate ptbr carlwednesday_88cb6798:

    # "He smirks at me."
    "Ele dá um sorrisinho pra mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:404
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cecdfc9b:

    # c "\"You one of those fat fetishists, just feeding me garbage so my moobs get bigger?\""
    c "\"Você é um daqueles fetichistas de gordo, que fica me enchendo de lixo pros meus peitinhos ficarem maiores?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:405
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3f5bc28b:

    # m "\"You don't have moobs; I've felt them.\""
    m "\"Você não tem peitinhos; eu já senti eles.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:406
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4d6c36d0:

    # c "\"Yeah, can't keep your paws off me. You have a thing for my fat ass?\""
    c "\"É, você não consegue tirar as patas de mim. Você tem uma queda pela minha bunda gorda?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:407
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7adb4bec:

    # "I look him over, as if studying his figure."
    "Eu dou uma olhada nele, como se estivesse estudando a sua forma."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:408
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d2e57561:

    # m "\"Hmmm...\""
    m "\"Hmmm...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:409
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3e794699:

    # c "\"Hey!\""
    c "\"Ei!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:410
translate ptbr carlwednesday_206be22f:

    # "He covers his chest."
    "Ele cobre o peito."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:411
translate ptbr carlwednesday_95e90336:

    # m "\"Well, I do actually like bigger guys and there's nothing wrong with extra weight, especially if it's carried well.\""
    m "\"Bom, eu gosto mesmo de caras maiores, e não tem nada de errado com peso extra, especialmente se ele cai bem em você.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:412
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b8087d79:

    # "He looks at me expectantly."
    "Ele olha pra mim com expectativa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:413
translate ptbr carlwednesday_60036104:

    # m "\"Which you do.\""
    m "\"E cai.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:414
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2d9a6a70:

    # c "\"Sweet! You know, you seem like you'd be a pretty dope boyfriend. Just feed me cake all day then get off on the results.\""
    c "\"Maneiro! Sabe, você parece que seria um namorado bem da hora. Só me daria bolo o dia todo e depois se amarraria nos resultados.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:415
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e74875bb:

    # "I'm about to shoot back with something snarky when a stumbling figure catches my eye."
    "Eu tô prestes a responder com algo sarcástico quando uma figura cambaleante chama a minha atenção."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:418
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5b819b7b:

    # "Out on the sunbaked asphalt of the road in front of Carl's house I see a thin figure...a weasel, I think, running up the road."
    "Lá fora, no asfalto ensolarado da rua em frente à casa do Carl, vejo uma figura magra... uma doninha, eu acho, correndo pela rua."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:419
translate ptbr carlwednesday_90bc1b69:

    # "He stops, panting, paws on his knees before he looks over his shoulder again."
    "Ele para, ofegante, com as patas nos joelhos, antes de olhar por cima do ombro de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:420
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a4a59f99:

    # "His whole body slumps, then, like the air's gone out of him, like he's giving up on something."
    "O corpo inteiro dele murcha, então, como se o ar tivesse saído dele, como se tivesse desistindo de alguma coisa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:421
translate ptbr carlwednesday_00bb43ba:

    # "He turns around to look back up the road."
    "Ele se vira pra olhar de volta pra rua."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:422
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1b026440:

    # "He's far away, but even from here I can tell that he's talking."
    "Ele tá longe, mas mesmo daqui dá pra ver que ele tá falando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:423
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7f74d751:

    # "Carl looks over at my silence, then down at the road where I'm looking."
    "O Carl olha pra mim, por causa do meu silêncio, e depois olha pra rua pra onde eu tô olhando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:424
translate ptbr carlwednesday_363f689c:

    # c "\"Hmmm...\""
    c "\"Hmmm...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:425
translate ptbr carlwednesday_facb95bf:

    # m "\"Is that...is that Duke?\""
    m "\"Aquele é... aquele é o Duke?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:426
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1397bbd6:

    # c "\"Yeah, that's him. Must be on something. He usually is.\""
    c "\"É, é ele. Deve ter usado alguma coisa. Ele geralmente usa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:427
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3719123e:

    # "Duke finally turns around and starts to cower, his paws up in surrender."
    "O Duke finalmente se vira e começa a se encolher, com as patas pra cima, se rendendo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:428
translate ptbr carlwednesday_94a530af:

    # "His lips are still moving, rapidly, reminding me of someone who's trying to say as much as they can before something cuts them off."
    "Os lábios dele ainda tão se movendo, rapidamente, me lembrando alguém que tá tentando dizer o máximo que puder antes que alguma coisa os interrompa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:429
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4d5c9257:

    # m "\"What do you think—\""
    m "\"O que você acha—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:430
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b8994b84:

    # "I trail off as Duke suddenly whips his head around to look up at us, then starts pointing, up at our balcony."
    "Eu paro de falar quando o Duke de repente vira a cabeça pra olhar pra nós, e depois começa a apontar, lá pra cima, pra nossa varanda."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:431
translate ptbr carlwednesday_18aa35db:

    # c "\"Uh-oh, let's hope the doors are locked.\""
    c "\"Uh-oh, vamos torcer pra que as portas estejam trancadas.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:432
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2dd13c19:

    # "Carl's chuckling, obviously finding the whole thing hilarious, but I'm a bit more on edge."
    "O Carl tá rindo, obviamente achando a coisa toda hilária, mas eu tô um pouco mais tenso."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:433
translate ptbr carlwednesday_855e6a2d:

    # "I don't really feel like he's high."
    "Eu não acho mesmo que ele esteja chapado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:434
translate ptbr carlwednesday_68c2ba19:

    # "Duke's movements are a lot more focused, more precise, like he's all there."
    "Os movimentos do Duke são muito mais focados, mais precisos, como se ele estivesse totalmente ali."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:435
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bffdbdf0:

    # "And for some reason it feels like he's looking directly at me."
    "E, por algum motivo, parece que ele tá olhando diretamente pra mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:436
translate ptbr carlwednesday_79309ba3:

    # "I furrow my brow, watching as the weasel turns toward us, sticking a foot out to take a step."
    "Eu franzo a testa, observando a doninha se virar na nossa direção, esticando um pé pra dar um passo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:438
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ce82f991:

    # "The sound of the sliding glass door wrenching open nearly makes me jump out of my skin."
    "O som da porta de vidro de correr se abrindo bruscamente quase me faz pular de susto."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:440
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e5ad4102:

    # j "\"What the hell are you guys doing?\""
    j "\"O que diabos vocês tão fazendo?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:441
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ee3e79fb:

    # "Jenna marches around the swing set to stand in front of us, paws on her hips."
    "A Jenna marcha ao redor do balanço e para na nossa frente, com as patas nos quadris."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:443
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5e3fbcfa:

    # c "\"Whoa. What's up, Jenna?\""
    c "\"Opa. Que foi, Jenna?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:444
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ff84623d:

    # "Carl leans back in the swing, elbows over the back, smiling."
    "O Carl se recosta no balanço, com os cotovelos sobre o encosto, sorrindo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:446
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5424ee90:

    # "The fox's eyes narrow as she sees the joint."
    "Os olhos da raposa se estreitam quando ela vê o baseado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:447
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7be81641:

    # j "\"Did you forget who this party was for?\""
    j "\"Você esqueceu pra quem era essa festa?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:448
translate ptbr carlwednesday_621ca2a9:

    # "Carl shrugs and rubs his forehead again."
    "O Carl dá de ombros e esfrega a testa de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:449
translate ptbr carlwednesday_98eea40e:

    # c "\"Leo, I'm guessing?\""
    c "\"Pro Leo, imagino?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:450
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bf59ed23:

    # j "\"No. We spent all day yesterday getting this ready for you, Leo especially. Now get back downstairs and have your party.\""
    j "\"Não. A gente passou o dia todo ontem preparando isso pra você, especialmente o Leo. Agora volta lá pra baixo e aproveita a sua festa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:452
translate ptbr carlwednesday_034d7a47:

    # "Carl sits quietly for a moment then glances at me."
    "O Carl fica sentado em silêncio por um momento e depois me lança um olhar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:454
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7e38b1b7:

    # c "\"No, no I don't think I will.\""
    c "\"Não, não, eu acho que não vou.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:455
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a47cf08e:

    # "He's not smiling anymore, his face expressionless, head turned back towards Jenna but his eyes are wandering off towards the side, looking at the sky."
    "Ele não tá sorrindo mais, com o rosto inexpressivo, a cabeça virada de volta pra Jenna, mas os olhos dele tão vagando pro lado, olhando pro céu."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:456
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5072630f:

    # j "\"Why not?\""
    j "\"Por que não?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:458
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c9e8793e:

    # c "\"Because I didn't fucking ask for it!\""
    c "\"Porque eu não pedi porra nenhuma!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:459
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ee05e132:

    # "I pretend to look at my phone."
    "Eu finjo olhar pro meu celular."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:460
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b8193c7e:

    # j "\"What, a party? I'm so sorry we were trying to be thoughtful, Carl, maybe we should just forget you next time, huh?\""
    j "\"O quê, uma festa? Desculpa se a gente tentou ser atencioso, Carl. Talvez a gente deva simplesmente esquecer você da próxima vez, hã?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:462
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bd0f7225:

    # m "\"Jenna, it's okay. We're just hangin' out...\""
    m "\"Jenna, tudo bem. A gente só tá conversando...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:463
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3f264bfa:

    # "She ignores me."
    "Ela me ignora."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:464
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4708be76:

    # "I see the skin inside Carl's ears and around his nose turning red."
    "Eu vejo a pele dentro das orelhas do Carl e ao redor do nariz dele ficando vermelha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:465
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7ff4cc56:

    # "Since he was a kid Carl didn't deal well with conflict, usually running away the first chance he got."
    "Desde criança, o Carl não lidava bem com conflitos, geralmente fugindo na primeira chance que tinha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:467
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b797fc36:

    # c "\"N-no, this was for Leo. I just don't understand why we couldn't do something that didn't involve—\""
    c "\"N-não, isso foi pro Leo. Eu só não entendo por que a gente não podia fazer alguma coisa que não envolvesse—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:468
translate ptbr carlwednesday_06718d50:

    # j "\"Sorry Carl, but that's life.\""
    j "\"Desculpa, Carl, mas a vida é assim.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:469
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cda633e0:

    # j "\"Sometimes you have to come out of your room.\""
    j "\"Às vezes você tem que sair do seu quarto.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:470
translate ptbr carlwednesday_81576f59:

    # j "\"Sometimes you have to be the center of attention and sometimes, God forbid, you have to talk to people.\""
    j "\"Às vezes você tem que ser o centro das atenções e às vezes, Deus me livre, você tem que falar com as pessoas.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:471
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b82b7da:

    # c "\"Well, what if I just wanna stay up here and hide? Who gives a fuck?\""
    c "\"Bem, e se eu só quiser ficar aqui em cima e me esconder? Quem se importa com essa porra?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:472
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2afdee8d:

    # "The look on Jenna's face is approaching contempt."
    "A expressão no rosto da Jenna tá beirando o desprezo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:473
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4308a1c7:

    # j "\"Are you kidding me? This is difficult for you?\""
    j "\"Você tá de brincadeira comigo? Isso é difícil pra você?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:474
translate ptbr carlwednesday_de1625b5:

    # m "\"Jenna.\""
    m "\"Jenna.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:475
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b069bffa:

    # "Again, she ignores me. I might as well be talking to a statue, or maybe I'm the statue that she isn't paying attention to."
    "De novo, ela me ignora. Eu poderia muito bem estar falando com uma estátua, ou talvez eu seja a estátua que ela não tá prestando atenção."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:476
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e6029de8:

    # "I feel like something must have happened downstairs. This isn't like her."
    "Eu sinto que algo deve ter acontecido lá embaixo. Isso não é do feitio dela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:477
translate ptbr carlwednesday_305c0711:

    # j "\"You never realize how good you have it, Carl. If you even had a taste of what I went through...\""
    j "\"Você nunca percebe o quão boa é a sua vida, Carl. Se você tivesse ao menos um gostinho do que eu passei...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:479
translate ptbr carlwednesday_faa4624e:

    # "I can practically feel the heat radiating off of Carl's body. He looks down at his lap."
    "Eu quase consigo sentir o calor irradiando do corpo do Carl. Ele abaixa o olhar pro colo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:480
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5638bc4a:

    # c "\"Are you blaming me for that?\""
    c "\"Você tá me culpando por isso?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:481
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5aa47945:

    # "His voice breaks."
    "A voz dele falha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:482
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a87f2c8d:

    # c "\"We all...we all have our problems.\""
    c "\"Todos nós... todos nós temos nossos problemas.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:483
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e90207a8:

    # j "\"Some easier than others.\""
    j "\"Alguns mais fáceis do que outros.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:485
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a8ff8d6e:

    # "Carl glares at her, trying to be angry, but I can tell it's not working."
    "O Carl encara ela, tentando ficar com raiva, mas dá pra ver que não tá funcionando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:486
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c1caeb6b:

    # c "\"You don't know what kind of shit I have to deal with.\""
    c "\"Você não sabe com que tipo de merda eu tenho que lidar.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:487
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5e423065:

    # j "\"Like being rich?\""
    j "\"Como ser rico?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:488
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cb990b21:

    # c "\"No! It's like...myself.\""
    c "\"Não! É tipo... comigo mesmo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:489
translate ptbr carlwednesday_705d20d4:

    # j "\"Oh how terrible! The one thing you have full control over.\""
    j "\"Oh, que terrível! A única coisa sobre a qual você tem controle total.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:490
translate ptbr carlwednesday_12a233be:

    # c "\"No...NO! That's so fucking unfair!\""
    c "\"Não... NÃO! Isso é tão injusto pra caralho!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:491
translate ptbr carlwednesday_88d54710:

    # "The quiver in Carl's voice doesn't exactly sound convincing, and the pot doesn't seem to be helping as I can see his fingers shaking."
    "O tremor na voz do Carl não soa exatamente convincente, e a maconha não parece tá ajudando, já que consigo ver os dedos dele tremendo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:492
translate ptbr carlwednesday_46327fe2:

    # j "\"Just like life.\""
    j "\"Assim como a vida.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:494
translate ptbr carlwednesday_80e78827:

    # "Carl's face is bewildered."
    "O rosto do Carl tá perplexo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:495
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f0014fb9:

    # c "\"What the fuck did I do, Jenna? Did I say something wrong earlier?\""
    c "\"O que caralhos eu fiz, Jenna? Eu falei alguma merda mais cedo?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:496
translate ptbr carlwednesday_83c90ebc:

    # "Out of habit he lifts the joint to his muzzle with his shaking fingers, but then flinches as Jenna steps forward."
    "Por força do hábito, ele levanta o baseado até o focinho com os dedos trêmulos, mas então recua quando a Jenna dá um passo à frente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:498
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5239861f:

    # "I guess he thought she was gonna slap him, or something, but instead she just reaches forward and plucks the joint out from his grasp—"
    "Eu acho que ele pensou que ela ia dar um tapa nele, ou algo assim, mas em vez disso ela só se estica e arranca o baseado da mão dele—"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:499
translate ptbr carlwednesday_28486ee3:

    # "—right before flicking it back into his face."
    "—logo antes de atirá-lo de volta na cara dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:500
translate ptbr carlwednesday_31694587:

    # "It hits his nose and Carl flinches again."
    "Bate no nariz dele e o Carl recua de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:503
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9ea22b3c:

    # "Without a word, Jenna spins on her heel and opens the door even harder than she did the first time."
    "Sem dizer uma palavra, a Jenna gira nos calcanhares e abre a porta ainda com mais força do que da primeira vez."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:505
translate ptbr carlwednesday_47ae2f8e:

    # "I'm stunned. I haven't seen Jenna that angry since she was in middle school and definitely never at Carl."
    "Eu tô atônito. Eu não via a Jenna tão brava desde que ela tava no ensino fundamental e com certeza nunca com o Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:507
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5c4b1449:

    # "Carl doesn't say anything, instead rubbing at his nose, leaning back in the seat."
    "O Carl não diz nada, em vez disso, esfrega o nariz, se recostando no assento."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:508
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c241fccd:

    # "The insides of his ears are still flushed a deep red."
    "O interior das orelhas dele ainda tá de um vermelho profundo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:509
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9072b50a:

    # c "\"What the fuck was that?\""
    c "\"Que porra foi essa?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:510
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cae3c8fd:

    # m "\"I...don't know. Something must have happened. That wasn't Jenna.\""
    m "\"Eu... não sei. Alguma coisa deve ter acontecido. Aquela não era a Jenna.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:511
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d0e44554:

    # m "\"I'll ask Leo about it...later.\""
    m "\"Eu vou perguntar pro Leo sobre isso... mais tarde.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:512
translate ptbr carlwednesday_89b48abc:

    # c "\"I didn't do anything, did I?\""
    c "\"Eu não fiz nada, fiz?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:513
translate ptbr carlwednesday_18371c22:

    # "I shrug, no words coming to mind."
    "Eu dou de ombros, sem que nenhuma palavra me venha à mente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:514
translate ptbr carlwednesday_70563324:

    # "We sit in silence a while, listening to the train horns."
    "A gente fica sentado em silêncio por um tempo, escutando as buzinas do trem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:515
translate ptbr carlwednesday_70ab2334:

    # "Looking down, I see the joint still smoking up from the planks of the floor."
    "Olhando pra baixo, eu vejo o baseado ainda soltando fumaça nas tábuas do chão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:516
translate ptbr carlwednesday_31d9f7fc:

    # "Slowly, I lean over and pick it up before holding it out to Carl."
    "Devagar, eu me inclino e pego ele antes de estender pro Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:517
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3ffcd23a:

    # "He takes it and looks at it for a second. Raising his paw he pauses then takes a drag before flicking it off the side of the balcony."
    "Ele pega e olha pra ele por um segundo. Levantando a pata, ele faz uma pausa e dá um trago antes de jogá-lo pra fora da varanda."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:518
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a9e21f7b:

    # "He lets his head sag, his big horns dipping towards the floor as he closes his eyes."
    "Ele deixa a cabeça cair, seus chifres grandes pendendo em direção ao chão enquanto ele fecha os olhos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:519
translate ptbr carlwednesday_46727784:

    # "Slowly, I put my arm around his shoulders."
    "Devagar, eu coloco meu braço em volta dos ombros dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:522
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e704b100:

    # "He leans into me and doesn't pull away."
    "Ele se apoia em mim e não se afasta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:529
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ea349ce6:

    # c "\"So it's over with Leo, huh?\""
    c "\"Então acabou com o Leo, hein?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:530
translate ptbr carlwednesday_95783deb:

    # "Carl waves his controller around like it's gonna help him avoid my three-spike throw, almost knocking over his beer bottle."
    "O Carl balança o controle dele como se isso fosse ajudar ele a desviar do meu arremesso de três espinhos, quase derrubando a garrafa de cerveja dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:531
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7f8f4a05:

    # "It hits him anyway and he gives a little grunt of annoyance."
    "Acerta ele de qualquer jeito e ele dá um pequeno grunhido de irritação."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:532
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0f73bcc3:

    # "I grin and consider letting up on him because he's clearly drunk."
    "Eu dou um sorriso e considero pegar leve com ele, porque ele claramente tá bêbado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:533
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8d70066f:

    # m "\"Seems that way. He hasn't really talked to me much since I got here.\""
    m "\"Parece que sim. Ele não falou muito comigo desde que cheguei aqui.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:534
translate ptbr carlwednesday_208d3a35:

    # "I leave out the part that that's probably my fault."
    "Eu omito a parte que isso provavelmente é culpa minha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:535
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f4a527b5:

    # "Carl lets out a weird little \"UH!\" sound as I punch his character as if he were the one getting punched instead."
    "O Carl solta um somzinho estranho de \"UH!\" quando eu dou um soco no personagem dele, como se fosse ele que tivesse sendo socado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:536
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9e6c132a:

    # c "\"Well that sucks...does it suck?\""
    c "\"Bem, isso é uma merda... é uma merda?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:537
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9137e505:

    # "He's looking intently at the screen."
    "Ele tá olhando fixamente pra tela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:538
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c94b8757:

    # "Still, I get the feeling he's not paying full attention because it's getting easier and easier to nail his character with my combos."
    "Ainda assim, eu tenho a sensação de que ele não tá prestando muita atenção porque tá ficando cada vez mais fácil acertar o personagem dele com meus combos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:539
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d9a4a56f:

    # m "\"I don't really know yet. It's been three years. Maybe it just hasn't kicked in yet?\""
    m "\"Eu ainda não sei direito. Fazem três anos. Talvez a ficha ainda não tenha caído?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:540
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a3ce4fe7:

    # c "\"Takes that long to kick in for you? When Tanya dumped me I felt like I couldn't get out of bed for a week.\""
    c "\"Leva tanto tempo assim pra sua ficha cair? Quando a Tanya me largou, eu senti que não conseguia sair da cama por uma semana.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:541
translate ptbr carlwednesday_89653dcc:

    # m "\"Oh God...\""
    m "\"Ai Deus...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:542
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d3b9f0f4:

    # "I remember that, back in high school, when we were both sixteen."
    "Eu me lembro disso, no colégio, quando nós dois tínhamos dezesseis anos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:543
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bb407772:

    # m "\"Didn't she get you into pot?\""
    m "\"Não foi ela que te apresentou à maconha?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:545
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df8c1ad4:

    # "Carl lets out a snort again as I flip-kick his demon character in the chin."
    "O Carl solta um bufo de novo quando eu dou um chute giratório no queixo do personagem demônio dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:546
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1db6301e:

    # c "\"Yep, and thank Satan for it! I don't know how else I would have gotten over her.\""
    c "\"Pois é, e graças a Satã por isso! Eu não sei de que outro jeito eu teria superado ela.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:548
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bf32b330:

    # c "\"Anyway, not to be a dick, but.. you're better for it.\""
    c "\"De qualquer forma, sem querer ser escroto, mas... você tá melhor sem ele.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:549
translate ptbr carlwednesday_24d7048f:

    # "He surprises me with a spin kick that sends my angel wolf character flying across the screen."
    "Ele me surpreende com um chute giratório que manda o meu personagem lobo anjo voando pela tela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:550
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4e81a4fb:

    # "I focus back on the game and throw a barrage of punches into his demon character's face, sending blood splashing onto the screen."
    "Eu volto a focar no jogo e jogo uma enxurrada de socos na cara do personagem demônio dele, fazendo sangue espirrar na tela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:551
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ba8d8248:

    # m "\"Oh?\""
    m "\"Ah é?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:552
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fb4dfc0b:

    # c "\"Well, you know...it's just hard to talk to you and Leo when you guys are being all lovey and shit.\""
    c "\"É que, sabe... é foda falar com você e o Leo quando vocês ficam todos amorozinhos e o caralho a quatro.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:553
translate ptbr carlwednesday_feef1479:

    # "His words are mushy, starting to bleed into one another."
    "As palavras dele tão pastosas, começando a se misturar umas nas outras."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:554
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d365ce6b:

    # "His character throws a flaming spear at my angel which I easily deflect with my Shimmering Shield."
    "O personagem dele joga uma lança em chamas no meu anjo, que eu defendo facilmente com o meu Escudo Cintilante."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:555
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f80f7b22:

    # "I extend my wings and swoop in to throw my lightning bolts."
    "Eu abro minhas asas e mergulho pra jogar meus raios."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:556
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6228b066:

    # m "\"Well you know, no one really tried to talk to us when we were together. It was like we were making you guys uncomfortable.\""
    m "\"Bom, cê sabe, ninguém tentava muito falar com a gente quando a gente tava junto. Era como se a gente deixasse vocês desconfortáveis.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:558
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6aaf1e87:

    # "I watch his demon fly in the air, surrounded by a glowing white circle."
    "Eu assisto o demônio dele voar pelos ares, cercado por um círculo branco brilhante."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:559
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cfe70d7a:

    # "Looking over I see Carl frowning."
    "Olhando pro lado, eu vejo o Carl franzindo a testa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:560
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8b041906:

    # c "\"No, I don't think so...\""
    c "\"Não, acho que não...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:561
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b0e0f30f:

    # "His demon spreads its own much spikier wings and hovers up from the circle."
    "O demônio dele abre suas próprias asas muito mais pontudas e paira do círculo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:562
translate ptbr carlwednesday_065d40d8:

    # "He reaches up into the sky and a red lighting bolt slams down into my character."
    "Ele alcança o céu e um raio vermelho atinge o meu personagem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:563
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9824964b:

    # c "\"You guys were just kind of self-absorbed. You didn't call me once after you guys started dating.\""
    c "\"Vocês só eram meio egocêntricos. Vocês não me ligaram nenhuma vez depois que começaram a namorar.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:564
translate ptbr carlwednesday_371e3935:

    # "And here I was thinking Carl never liked conflict. That sentence carried a lot of weight...and a lot of years behind it."
    "E eu aqui pensando que o Carl nunca gostou de conflito. Essa frase carregou muito peso... e muitos anos por trás dela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:565
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7a6bdeb2:

    # "I'm not about to argue with him, though, especially after what happened with Jenna."
    "Mas eu não vou discutir com ele, especialmente depois do que aconteceu com a Jenna."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:566
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b0d8bee8:

    # "That lighting bolt was it for my wolf angel and his demon flies up to the screen and flips us off as \"WINNER\" is displayed."
    "Aquele raio foi o fim pro meu lobo anjo e o demônio dele voa pra tela e mostra o dedo do meio pra nós enquanto \"VENCEDOR\" aparece."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:567
translate ptbr carlwednesday_12864627:

    # m "\"Well, there was college.\""
    m "\"Bom, teve a faculdade.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:568
translate ptbr carlwednesday_195f5652:

    # "Carl stretches, leaning back in the giant beanbag chair we're sitting on."
    "O Carl se espreguiça, se recostando no pufe gigante que a gente tá sentado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:569
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c22489fa:

    # c "\"I don't remember much of college anymore.\""
    c "\"Eu não lembro muito da faculdade mais.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:571
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f27365eb:

    # "He lays back in the chair and looks over at me."
    "Ele se recosta na cadeira e olha pra mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:572
translate ptbr carlwednesday_793761e7:

    # c "\"By the way, I have a job interview on Friday.\""
    c "\"A propósito, eu tenho uma entrevista de emprego na sexta.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:573
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cca89d89:

    # "My eyes widen."
    "Meus olhos se arregalam."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:574
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a3963e0f:

    # c "\"Don't act so surprised assssshole\""
    c "\"Não finja estar tão surpreso cuuuuuuzão.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:575
translate ptbr carlwednesday_edcf83a4:

    # "He hangs on to the last word with a lisp."
    "Ele estica a última palavra, com a língua enrolada."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:576
translate ptbr carlwednesday_18af9f8e:

    # m "\"You're drunk, but that's awesome! Where at?\""
    m "\"Você tá bêbado, mas isso é incrível! Aonde?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:577
translate ptbr carlwednesday_48056d15:

    # c "\"A print shop...be a production assistant.\""
    c "\"Uma gráfica... pra ser assistente de produção.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:578
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d2f30932:

    # m "\"Well that sounds decent.\""
    m "\"Bom, parece decente.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:579
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b3ef8e37:

    # c "\"Yeah, parents told me they'd buy me a car to get there. It's in Payton, of course.\""
    c "\"É, meus pais disseram que comprariam um carro pra eu ir até lá. Fica em Payton, é claro.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:581
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f4e42abb:

    # c "\"But anyway, Flynn told me he'd give me a ride to the interview, but since you're here...\""
    c "\"Mas enfim, o Flynn me disse que me daria uma carona pra entrevista, mas já que você tá aqui...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:582
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6d384e5a:

    # "He gives me a lazy sidelong glance."
    "Ele me lança um olhar preguiçoso de soslaio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:583
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8f966f1f:

    # "While I usually wouldn't have an issue with it, the thought of how hard I'd been procrastinating my school project is starting to make my stomach churn."
    "Embora eu normalmente não tivesse problema com isso, o pensamento do quanto eu ando procrastinando no meu projeto da faculdade tá começando a embrulhar meu estômago."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:584
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b4ac08cf:

    # "But hey, how often will I get to hang out with Carl when the break is over?"
    "Mas ei, com que frequência eu vou conseguir passar um tempo com o Carl quando as férias acabarem?"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:585
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9437a398:

    # m "\"I'd love to take you.\""
    m "\"Eu adoraria te levar.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:586
translate ptbr carlwednesday_77bad996:

    # m "\"You know, we were gonna go out and do stuff tomorrow...why don't we change your look? Get you new clothes, or something, for your interview?\""
    m "\"Sabe, a gente ia sair e fazer algumas coisas amanhã... por que não mudamos o seu visual? Comprar roupas novas pra você, ou algo assim, pra sua entrevista?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:587
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6ee974ed:

    # "He keeps smiling."
    "Ele continua sorrindo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:588
translate ptbr carlwednesday_538e41c2:

    # c "\"Sounds great.\""
    c "\"Parece ótimo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:589
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b76f163f:

    # c "\"So what's it like, kissing a dude?\""
    c "\"Então, como é beijar um cara?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:590
translate ptbr carlwednesday_18c87026:

    # "I let out a surprised laugh."
    "Eu solto uma risada de surpresa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:591
translate ptbr carlwednesday_486a0250:

    # m "\"What!?\""
    m "\"O quê!?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:592
translate ptbr carlwednesday_51307862:

    # c "\"You know. Is it like, more...\""
    c "\"Sabe. É tipo, mais...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:593
translate ptbr carlwednesday_33efec01:

    # "He wiggles his paws uselessly in the air."
    "Ele balança as patas inutilmente no ar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:594
translate ptbr carlwednesday_aeee5693:

    # m "\"I...I don't know?\""
    m "\"Eu... Eu não sei?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:595
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d874f728:

    # c "\"You kissed a girl, right? Um, Samantha, right?\""
    c "\"Você beijou uma garota, né? Hum, Samantha, né?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:596
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6abc3d66:

    # m "\"I think so? But that was like, seventh grade.\""
    m "\"Acho que sim? Mas isso foi tipo, na sétima série.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:597
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e89a16b7:

    # c "\"So was it different?\""
    c "\"Então foi diferente?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:598
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0fe27a93:

    # "I laugh at him again."
    "Eu rio dele de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:599
translate ptbr carlwednesday_304d30ca:

    # m "\"Pretty sure it's just like kissing a girl, man.\""
    m "\"Tenho quase certeza de que é igualzinho a beijar uma garota, cara.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:600
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df828704:

    # c "\"You sure?\""
    c "\"Tem certeza?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:601
translate ptbr carlwednesday_dac5a450:

    # m "\"I feel like kissing different species would be even more different.\""
    m "\"Eu acho que beijar espécies diferentes seria ainda mais diferente.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:603
translate ptbr carlwednesday_dbf2ecdb:

    # c "\"Maybe...I've-I've always sort of wanted to know what it's like.\""
    c "\"Talvez... eu-eu sempre quis meio que saber como é.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:605
translate ptbr carlwednesday_40848bad:

    # "He says it slowly, deliberately, trying not to trip over his words."
    "Ele diz isso devagar, deliberadamente, tentando não tropeçar nas palavras."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:606
translate ptbr carlwednesday_755d3b71:

    # m "\"Yeeaah?\""
    m "\"Éeeh?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:607
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fa78df30:

    # "I say it even slower, because I think I know what Carl's getting at."
    "Eu digo isso ainda mais devagar, porque acho que sei aonde o Carl quer chegar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:608
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ddc01ba0:

    # c "\"I can see how guys can be sexy...\""
    c "\"Eu consigo ver como caras podem ser sexy...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:609
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b412cb82:

    # m "\"Carl, are you coming out to me?\""
    m "\"Carl, você tá saindo do armário pra mim?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:611
translate ptbr carlwednesday_423ce27a:

    # "He rolls over onto his stomach, facing me fully now."
    "Ele rola de bruços, ficando totalmente de frente pra mim agora."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:612
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c0880552:

    # c "\"That's.. that's a good question! Maybe we can answer it.\""
    c "\"Essa é.. essa é uma boa pergunta! Talvez a gente possa responder ela.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:613
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a9094257:

    # "I'm a little buzzed, but not drunk."
    "Eu tô um pouco alegre, mas não bêbado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:614
translate ptbr carlwednesday_06bccc9d:

    # m "\"Are you asking if you can kiss me?\""
    m "\"Você tá perguntando se pode me beijar?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:615
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4e5a72c4:

    # "He gazes at me lazily through lidded eyes, looking about ready to fall asleep."
    "Ele me olha com preguiça através dos olhos semicerrados, parecendo prestes a cair no sono."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:616
translate ptbr carlwednesday_03534f63:

    # c "\"Only.. only if you want.\""
    c "\"Só.. só se você quiser.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:617
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f41d50ec:

    # "I'd been asked to be the experiment of a few guys in the past, in college, and I'd always said no, but Carl..."
    "Já me pediram pra ser a experiência de alguns caras no passado, na faculdade, e eu sempre disse não, mas o Carl..."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:621
translate ptbr carlwednesday_76a95f3f:

    # m "\"Heh, if you want.\""
    m "\"Heh, se você quiser.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:622
translate ptbr carlwednesday_34fed08d:

    # "Carl's eyes widen slightly then he slowly gets to his hands and knees and crawls towards me."
    "Os olhos do Carl se arregalam um pouco e então ele fica de quatro devagar e engatinha na minha direção."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:623
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a22c1dd0:

    # "I was gonna stand up, but it looks like he wants to do this on the beanbag."
    "Eu ia me levantar, mas parece que ele quer fazer isso no pufe."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:624
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fe10ab79:

    # m "\"Uh...\""
    m "\"Hã...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:625
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9775e58e:

    # "I lean back in the bag, sinking into it a bit more."
    "Eu me recosto no pufe, afundando um pouco mais."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:626
translate ptbr carlwednesday_52b2ab31:

    # "Carl kneels at my feet, looking unsure."
    "O Carl se ajoelha aos meus pés, parecendo inseguro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:627
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cc4daa88:

    # c "\"Is this right?\""
    c "\"Isso tá certo?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:628
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5e435b31:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah. Do you want me to sta—\""
    m "\"Hã, sim. Você quer que eu lev—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:629
translate ptbr carlwednesday_612670c7:

    # "Before I know it he's crawled up on top of me."
    "Antes que eu perceba, ele já engatinhou pra cima de mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:630
translate ptbr carlwednesday_14d5380c:

    # "His presence is heavy and warm and I lean back, feeling myself get hard despite the awkwardness of it all."
    "A presença dele é pesada e quente, e eu me recosto, me sentindo ficar duro apesar do constrangimento de tudo isso."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:631
translate ptbr carlwednesday_afcd47e8:

    # "He looks down at me, into my eyes, and I feel myself blush."
    "Ele olha pra mim, nos meus olhos, e eu sinto que coro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:632
translate ptbr carlwednesday_26368f32:

    # c "\"S-sorry. Is this okay?\""
    c "\"D-desculpa. Assim tá bom?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:633
translate ptbr carlwednesday_405ce77d:

    # m "\"Yeah, it's fine...\""
    m "\"Sim, tá de boa...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:635
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fd2a0b33:

    # "He leans down, pauses, then leans in all the way and I feel his soft, wide muzzle against mine."
    "Ele se inclina, faz uma pausa, depois se aproxima de vez e eu sinto o focinho macio e largo dele contra o meu."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:636
translate ptbr carlwednesday_237e395e:

    # "At the same time I feel one of his paws slide behind my head."
    "Ao mesmo tempo, sinto uma das patas dele deslizar pra trás da minha cabeça."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:637
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ed78ff2a:

    # "It's different than kissing Leo, or Samantha way back in middle school. Carl's muzzle is big and more blunt, his lips softer and more malleable."
    "É diferente de beijar o Leo, ou a Samantha lá no ensino fundamental. O focinho do Carl é grande e mais achatado, os lábios dele mais macios e maleáveis."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:638
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4b7dcf1f:

    # "It covers the entire front of my muzzle. His beard tickles my neck and cheeks."
    "Cobre toda a frente do meu focinho. A barba dele faz cócegas no meu pescoço e bochechas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:639
translate ptbr carlwednesday_278e448a:

    # "I expect him to pull back quickly, but he doesn't, keeping his paw behind my head and pressing deeper into the kiss."
    "Eu espero que ele recue rápido, mas ele não o faz, mantendo a pata atrás da minha cabeça e se aprofundando mais no beijo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:640
translate ptbr carlwednesday_615b99f2:

    # "His other paw holds on to my upper arm."
    "A outra pata dele segura no meu braço."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:641
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2b682c52:

    # "I open my eyes and see that his are closed."
    "Eu abro meus olhos e vejo que os dele tão fechados."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:642
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8408edec:

    # "He hunches over me, closer, and I feel myself start to respond, reaching up to wrap my arms around his broad back."
    "Ele se curva sobre mim, mais perto, e eu sinto que começo a corresponder, levantando os braços pra abraçar as costas largas dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:643
translate ptbr carlwednesday_22c2575a:

    # "He huffs in response and then I feel his lips part and his tongue flicks against my lips."
    "Ele bufa em resposta e então eu sinto os lábios dele se abrirem e a língua dele roça nos meus lábios."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:644
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c670cad7:

    # "I start to open them, but that's when I feel the beanbag shift and Carl slides to the side."
    "Eu começo a abri-los, mas é aí que sinto o pufe se mexer e o Carl desliza pro lado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:645
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6898421f:

    # "Somehow he manages to slip and fall on the wobbly beanbag, his mouth sliding sloppily off mine as he slumps down on top of me."
    "De algum jeito ele consegue escorregar e cair no pufe instável, a boca dele deslizando desajeitadamente da minha enquanto ele desaba em cima de mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:647
translate ptbr carlwednesday_74ff6190:

    # "I let out a grunt as his weight comes to rest on my chest. He chuckles and I can feel the spasms all the way through my own body."
    "Eu solto um grunhido quando o peso dele recai sobre o meu peito. Ele ri baixinho e eu consigo sentir os espasmos por todo o meu próprio corpo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:648
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0ff93c76:

    # c "\"Hehe, oops.\""
    c "\"Hehe, opa.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:649
translate ptbr carlwednesday_89a4db4d:

    # "I laugh, too, then wait a while, but he doesn't move."
    "Eu rio também, depois espero um pouco, mas ele não se mexe."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:650
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5d06faee:

    # m "\"Um, Carl? You—you can get off now.\""
    m "\"Hum, Carl? Você—você pode sair de cima agora.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:651
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3772f7eb:

    # "He doesn't say anything."
    "Ele não diz nada."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:652
translate ptbr carlwednesday_137b5ef5:

    # "I'm about to say something else when I hear a deep snore right next to my ear."
    "Eu tô prestes a dizer alguma outra coisa quando ouço um ronco profundo bem do lado da minha orelha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:653
translate ptbr carlwednesday_74dba477:

    # m "\"Carl?\""
    m "\"Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:654
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a9f99b78:

    # "His response is another guttural snore."
    "A resposta dele é outro ronco gutural."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:655
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8be437bc:

    # "I shift under him, for the first time realizing how actually fucking heavy he is."
    "Eu me ajeito debaixo dele, percebendo pela primeira vez o quão pesado pra caralho ele realmente é."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:656
translate ptbr carlwednesday_98d72ea0:

    # "It's not exactly a bad feeling; his presence is enveloping and warm, and the beanbag under me is offering enough cushion so I'm not getting crushed."
    "Não é exatamente uma sensação ruim; a presença dele é envolvente e quente, e o pufe debaixo de mim tá oferecendo amortecimento suficiente pra eu não ser esmagado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:657
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6ba17e9b:

    # "The snoring isn't bad either. It's almost comforting as his breath tickles the hairs inside my ear."
    "O ronco também não é ruim. É quase reconfortante enquanto a respiração dele faz cócegas nos pelos dentro da minha orelha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:658
translate ptbr carlwednesday_327a8613:

    # "His big belly squishes up against my torso like like a warm sandbag."
    "A barriga grande dele se aperta contra o meu torso como se fosse um saco de areia quente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:659
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9d4a9d48:

    # "My eyes are heavy and, slowly, I wrap my arms around his back."
    "Meus olhos tão pesados e, devagar, eu passo meus braços em volta das costas dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:660
translate ptbr carlwednesday_68f12b68:

    # "I haven't had someone to sleep with in years and now I realize how much I miss the feeling."
    "Eu não tenho alguém pra dormir comigo há anos e agora eu percebo o quanto sinto falta da sensação."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:661
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3db306d3:

    # "Slowly, the dim lights in Carl's room fade out as I fall asleep to his comforting, rhythmic snores."
    "Devagar, as luzes fracas do quarto do Carl se apagam enquanto eu adormeço com seus roncos confortantes e rítmicos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:663
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1e4edd2e:

    # "I smirk at him."
    "Eu dou um sorriso de lado pra ele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:664
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0afb9aea:

    # m "\"Carl, you're drunk.\""
    m "\"Carl, você tá bêbado.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:665
translate ptbr carlwednesday_36262d7e:

    # c "\"No I'm not.\""
    c "\"Não, não tô.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:666
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7f7c7009:

    # "He bursts into giggles even before he finishes the sentence."
    "Ele cai na risada antes mesmo de terminar a frase."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:667
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4eeb8836:

    # "The ram then decides to roll over.. directly onto my chest."
    "O carneiro então decide rolar.. direto pro meu peito."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:668
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7ba0f90d:

    # "I let out a quiet 'urk', trying to push him off my more sensitive areas."
    "Eu solto um 'urk' baixinho, tentando empurrar ele das minhas áreas mais sensíveis."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:669
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d9e95e94:

    # "Fortunately, he seems to get the hint and props himself up on his elbows."
    "Felizmente, ele parece entender a dica e se apoia nos cotovelos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:670
translate ptbr carlwednesday_686b61d7:

    # m "\"Tell you what; if you ask me again in the morning sober...I'll say yes.\""
    m "\"Seguinte; se você me perguntar de novo de manhã, sóbrio... eu digo que sim.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:671
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d6add429:

    # c "\"Awww...come ooooon.\""
    c "\"Awww... qual ééé.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:673
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d3a13635:

    # "I'm about to chide him some more, but that's when he starts snoring..."
    "Eu tô prestes a dar mais uma bronca nele, mas é aí que ele começa a roncar..."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:674
translate ptbr carlwednesday_70092d19:

    # "I smile some, peering down at Carl."
    "Eu dou um sorrisinho, olhando pra baixo pro Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:675
translate ptbr carlwednesday_63c55924:

    # "This is actually pretty comfortable. Maybe I'm just touch starved or something?"
    "Isso é na verdade bem confortável. Talvez eu só esteja carente de toque ou algo assim?"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:676
translate ptbr carlwednesday_928ccc71:

    # "Whatever it is, I'm left with some slight bittersweetness as I remind myself Carl probably wouldn't have the courage to do this sober."
    "Seja o que for, eu fico com um leve sentimento agridoce enquanto me lembro de que o Carl provavelmente não teria a coragem de fazer isso sóbrio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:677
translate ptbr carlwednesday_61fb2bdd:

    # "Whether he's just messing around or not, this is nice - watching his large chest rise and fall."
    "Seja ele só brincando ou não, isso é legal - ver o peito grande dele subir e descer."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:678
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3db306d3_1:

    # "Slowly, the dim lights in Carl's room fade out as I fall asleep to his comforting, rhythmic snores."
    "Devagar, as luzes fracas do quarto do Carl se apagam enquanto eu adormeço com seus roncos confortantes e rítmicos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:685
translate ptbr carlwednesday_55f44e0f:

    # t "\"Stoooop!\""
    t "\"Paaaaara!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:687
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3e5a14ee:

    # "I heave for breath as I chase TJ down the dusty street, trying not to pop the water balloon that I'm holding with my claws."
    "Eu ofego enquanto persigo o TJ pela rua empoeirada, tentando não estourar a bexiga d'água que tô segurando com as minhas garras."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:688
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c3b53f41:

    # t "\"You always chase me!\""
    t "\"Você sempre me persegue!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:689
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bf7546f2:

    # "TJ's whining again, but I don't care. He's always the funnest one to hit. His crazy speed made it all the more rewarding."
    "O TJ tá choramingando de novo, mas eu não ligo. Ele sempre é o mais divertido de acertar. A velocidade maluca dele deixava tudo ainda mais gratificante."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:690
translate ptbr carlwednesday_afe90c9e:

    # "Even though he's a grade lower he could outrun me easily."
    "Mesmo ele sendo de uma série anterior, ele conseguia correr mais do que eu facilmente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:691
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cab49d3c:

    # "I can still keep up with him, though, since he's running around houses and mailboxes."
    "Mas eu ainda consigo acompanhá-lo, já que ele tá correndo em volta de casas e caixas de correio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:692
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ad96facb:

    # "My fourth-grade brain is easily able to figure out ways to cut him off."
    "Meu cérebro da quarta série consegue facilmente descobrir maneiras de cortar o caminho dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:693
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a876c849:

    # "It's not long before I have him backed up against the back of the Benally's trailer home."
    "Não demora muito e eu o encurralo contra os fundos do trailer da família Benally."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:694
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e6208c7e:

    # "He does a stupid dance where he's running back and forth, covering his head."
    "Ele faz uma dancinha estúpida onde fica correndo de um lado pro outro, cobrindo a cabeça."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:695
translate ptbr carlwednesday_55f44e0f_1:

    # t "\"Stoooop!\""
    t "\"Paaaaara!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:696
translate ptbr carlwednesday_82df72c6:

    # "I stick my tongue out the side of my muzzle, following him back and forth with the balloon I have cocked behind my head."
    "Eu boto a língua pra fora no canto do focinho, seguindo ele de um lado pro outro com a bexiga engatilhada atrás da cabeça."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:697
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5c5e23eb:

    # m "\"Hold still!\""
    m "\"Fica parado!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:698
translate ptbr carlwednesday_365f6138:

    # t "\"No!\""
    t "\"Não!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:699
translate ptbr carlwednesday_300ff958:

    # "He finally curls up into a ball against the house, crouching in the dirt in his blue swim trunks."
    "Ele finalmente se encolhe feito uma bola contra a casa, agachado na terra com seu calção de banho azul."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:700
translate ptbr carlwednesday_72833b9d:

    # "I stop."
    "Eu paro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:701
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ecc85408:

    # m "\"Well it's not fun if you're not gonna try to run.\""
    m "\"Bom, não tem graça se você não vai tentar correr.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:702
translate ptbr carlwednesday_dbef61c9:

    # "He looks up at me between his fingers."
    "Ele olha pra cima pra mim entre os dedos."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:703
translate ptbr carlwednesday_653529f1:

    # t "\"You always throw it too hard!\""
    t "\"Você sempre joga muito forte!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:704
translate ptbr carlwednesday_64c98fc5:

    # m "\"Well if you—\""
    m "\"Bom, se você—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:705
translate ptbr carlwednesday_faedb1ef:

    # "He suddenly darts to the right, but I'm ready, hurling the balloon right at his back."
    "De repente ele corre pra direita, mas eu tô pronto, arremessando a bexiga direto nas costas dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:706
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e14def5e:

    # "It doesn't explode, though, instead smacking against his spotted back with a wet splat."
    "Mas ela não explode, em vez disso, bate contra as costas pintadas dele com um som molhado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:708
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ea9b473e:

    # t "\"OW!\""
    t "\"AI!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:710
translate ptbr carlwednesday_04edcf7a:

    # "He skids to a stop, then immediately bends and scoops up the balloon, grinning at how the tables had turned."
    "Ele freia derrapando, depois imediatamente se abaixa e pega a bexiga, sorrindo com a forma como o jogo virou."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:711
translate ptbr carlwednesday_48e9a5d0:

    # m "\"Uh-oh...\""
    m "\"Uh-oh...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:713
translate ptbr carlwednesday_40e685c9:

    # "I start jogging backwards as TJ heaves back with the balloon.. but I don't have anything to worry about."
    "Eu começo a trotar pra trás enquanto o TJ se inclina pra trás com a bexiga... mas eu não tenho com o que me preocupar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:714
translate ptbr carlwednesday_67fe94da:

    # "In his excitement he grips the balloon too hard and I can see how his claws dimple the rubber before it explodes mid-throw."
    "Na empolgação, ele aperta a bexiga muito forte e eu consigo ver como as garras dele afundam a borracha antes que ela exploda no meio do arremesso."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:715
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d994279d:

    # "Water showers his head and dust kicks up as dark spots speckle the ground just like his fur, I think."
    "Uma chuva de água cai sobre a cabeça dele e poeira sobe enquanto manchas escuras salpicam o chão assim como a pelagem dele, eu acho."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:716
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6aa5a9d8:

    # "He gasps the way cats do whenever they get any water on them and I point and laugh."
    "Ele ofega do jeito que os gatos fazem quando cai água neles e eu aponto e rio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:717
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5768b17d:

    # "I can tell he's deciding whether or not to sulk and cry and I hold my breath because I don't want the game to end."
    "Eu consigo perceber que ele tá decidindo se emburra e chora ou não, e eu prendo a respiração porque não quero que a brincadeira acabe."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:718
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b4ff3e58:

    # "I think I win him over because he smiles and starts to laugh, too."
    "Eu acho que consigo convencê-lo porque ele sorri e começa a rir também."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:720
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2f25ab42:

    # t "\"That always happens to me!\""
    t "\"Isso sempre acontece comigo!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:721
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b76e2ecc:

    # m "\"Well don't hold it so hard.\""
    m "\"Bom, não segura tão forte.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:722
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c6210b21:

    # t "\"I wasn't!\""
    t "\"Eu não tava!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:723
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1208310f:

    # m "\"Yeah you were, I saw—\""
    m "\"Tava sim, eu vi—\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:726
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6ee00b18:

    # "I see TJ's ears perk and he looks over, towards the front of the house."
    "Eu vejo as orelhas do TJ se levantarem e ele olha, pra frente da casa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:727
translate ptbr carlwednesday_df8ec4bc_3:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:728
translate ptbr carlwednesday_700f8e08:

    # "But that's when I hear it, too."
    "Mas é aí que eu escuto, também."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:729
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3b3d52d0:

    # "???" "\"-doin' with those water balloons?\""
    "???" "\"-fazendo com essas bexigas d'água?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:730
translate ptbr carlwednesday_334a6da2:

    # c "\"Don't touch me!\""
    c "\"Não me toca!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:731
translate ptbr carlwednesday_38e8e354:

    # "???" "\"I'm not touching you. Just give me the fucking balloons.\""
    "???" "\"Eu não tô te tocando. Só me dá as porras das bexigas.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:732
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f5cfeb78:

    # "Clint and Jeremy. Carl must have followed us and they saw him out the window."
    "Clint e Jeremy. O Carl deve ter seguido a gente e eles viram ele pela janela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:734
translate ptbr carlwednesday_51daf998:

    # "My guts drop to my feet and I feel like I'm gonna pee myself."
    "Meu estômago afunda até os pés e sinto que vou fazer xixi nas calças."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:736
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a160258c:

    # "TJ covers his mouth and I see tears starting to brim in his eyes."
    "O TJ cobre a boca e eu vejo as lágrimas começando a se formar nos olhos dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:737
translate ptbr carlwednesday_215ce2d5:

    # "I think fast."
    "Eu penso rápido."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:738
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bb20201e:

    # m "\"G-go run and get Leo, he can help!\""
    m "\"C-corre e chama o Leo, ele pode ajudar!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:740
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7a161473:

    # "Before I know it, TJ's tearing across the backyards of the houses, up the block where Leo's filling water balloons."
    "Antes que eu perceba, o TJ tá correndo pelos quintais das casas, subindo o quarteirão onde o Leo tá enchendo as bexigas d'água."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:741
translate ptbr carlwednesday_81cdb775:

    # "At least that's where I hope he's going."
    "Pelo menos é pra lá que eu espero que ele esteja indo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:742
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1970b752:

    # "Slowly, I pad around the house, peeking around the corner to the front yard."
    "Devagar, eu ando em volta da casa, espiando pelo canto pro quintal da frente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:744
translate ptbr carlwednesday_67f94111:

    # "Carl's standing with his fists clenched, staring hard, trying to look defiant, but I can tell he's terrified."
    "O Carl tá de pé com os punhos cerrados, encarando firme, tentando parecer desafiador, mas eu percebo que ele tá apavorado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:745
translate ptbr carlwednesday_44c7ffa6:

    # "Multi-colored water balloons are scattered around his hooves; he must have been carrying them all in his white tank top."
    "Bexigas d'água coloridas tão espalhadas pelos cascos dele; ele devia estar carregando todas elas na regata branca dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:746
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2cec1bb7:

    # "He always wore a shirt when we did water games."
    "Ele sempre usava camiseta quando a gente brincava com água."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:747
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fc49db8f:

    # cl "\"What'sa matter, cunt-face? We're not gonna hurt ya...\""
    cl "\"Qual o problema, cara de boceta? A gente não vai te machucar...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:748
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4b8a7f78:

    # jer "\"Heh, right.\""
    jer "\"Heh, é.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:749
translate ptbr carlwednesday_255c0a80:

    # "Jeremy laughs stupidly at Clint and bends down to pick up a purple water balloon."
    "O Jeremy ri idiotamente pro Clint e se abaixa pra pegar uma bexiga d'água roxa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:750
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cf3c657c:

    # "Clint starts circling around Carl and the ram follows him with his muzzle, nostrils flaring."
    "O Clint começa a circular em volta do Carl e o carneiro o acompanha com o focinho, as narinas dilatadas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:751
translate ptbr carlwednesday_de4e1573:

    # "As he's looking the other way, Jeremy throws the water balloon right in Carl's face."
    "Como ele tá olhando pro outro lado, o Jeremy joga a bexiga d'água bem na cara do Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:753
translate ptbr carlwednesday_dd19b25d:

    # "Following the smack of rubber on muzzle the balloon explodes, showering all three of them in water."
    "Seguido pelo estalo da borracha no focinho, a bexiga explode, dando um banho de água nos três."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:754
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3601d753:

    # "Carl whimpers and covers his face. I grip the side of the house, knowing I should do something, but my legs aren't moving."
    "O Carl choraminga e cobre o rosto. Eu me agarro na lateral da casa, sabendo que deveria fazer alguma coisa, mas minhas pernas não se mexem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:755
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f1f3cd0e:

    # c "\"Leave me alone!\""
    c "\"Me deixem em paz!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:756
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2125f547:

    # "Carl's doing a good job of not crying, but he's about to."
    "O Carl tá fazendo um bom trabalho pra não chorar, mas ele tá quase lá."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:757
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7933da90:

    # cl "\"Hey, we're just playin'.\""
    cl "\"Ei, a gente só tá brincando.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:758
translate ptbr carlwednesday_94e94814:

    # "Clint leans down to pick up another water balloon."
    "O Clint se abaixa pra pegar outra bexiga d'água."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:760
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a0aa4d21:

    # "That's when Carl makes a break for it, dodging around the bent-over Clint towards the street."
    "É aí que o Carl dá no pé, desviando do Clint curvado em direção à rua."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:761
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cdfd475e:

    # "Clint's too fast, though, and the ring-tailed cat instantly reaches out and catches Carl by one of his horns."
    "Mas o Clint é muito rápido, e o cacomistle imediatamente estende a mão e agarra o Carl por um dos chifres."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:762
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e7b653db:

    # "He rides him for a second, jumping on Carl's back before using his long tail to trip the ram up."
    "Ele monta nele por um segundo, pulando nas costas do Carl antes de usar a longa cauda pra dar uma rasteira no carneiro."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:763
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1d31a666:

    # "Carl lands on his stomach with a loud grunt as Clint sits on his back, holding onto his horns."
    "O Carl cai de bruços com um grunhido alto quando o Clint senta nas costas dele, segurando nos chifres dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:764
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f58c3e25:

    # cl "\"CUNT! He stepped on my tail!\""
    cl "\"SEU MERDA! Ele pisou no meu rabo!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:765
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d40cc059:

    # "Clint grabs both of Carl's horns and leans back so far I think I can hear his spine cracking."
    "O Clint agarra ambos os chifres do Carl e se inclina pra trás tão longe que acho que consigo ouvir a espinha dele estalar."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:766
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8ffd34fe:

    # "Carl screams in pain and reaches for his horns. With his face pointed at the sky I can see the tears rolling down his face now."
    "O Carl grita de dor e tenta alcançar os próprios chifres. Com o rosto dele apontado pro céu, eu consigo ver as lágrimas escorrendo pelo rosto dele agora."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:767
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b5ce17a8:

    # "The one eye I can see is open wide, and I think he sees me, but still my legs won't move."
    "O único olho que eu consigo ver tá arregalado, e eu acho que ele me vê, mas ainda assim minhas pernas não se mexem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:768
translate ptbr carlwednesday_014fc27b:

    # l "\"'EY!\""
    l "\"EI!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:770
translate ptbr carlwednesday_48b799d8:

    # "Leo jogs up the street, looking right at Clint."
    "O Leo vem correndo pela rua, olhando direto pro Clint."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:771
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4527a828:

    # "The ringtail sneers but drops Carl back to the ground and stands up as Leo gets closer."
    "O cacomistle zomba, mas solta o Carl de volta no chão e se levanta enquanto o Leo se aproxima."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:772
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c9cbb2b7:

    # cl "\"The fuck do you want, beaner?\""
    cl "\"Que porra cê quer, cucaracho?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:773
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fd94546e:

    # "Clint's weary, his casual demeanor more tense now that Leo's here."
    "O Clint tá cauteloso, o jeito casual dele mais tenso agora que o Leo tá aqui."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:775
translate ptbr carlwednesday_527edeb3:

    # "I sigh with relief. Carl sits up and quickly rubs his face before standing and running back up the street, his hooves clopping loudly all the way."
    "Eu suspiro de alívio. O Carl se senta e esfrega o rosto rapidamente antes de se levantar e correr de volta pela rua, os cascos dele estalando alto por todo o caminho."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:777
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2af79e17:

    # "Leo doesn't even look at him, his eyes on Clint."
    "O Leo nem olha pra ele, com os olhos fixos no Clint."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:778
translate ptbr carlwednesday_773c41bc:

    # cl "\"I said what do you want? You no understand?\""
    cl "\"Eu disse, o que cê quer? Você não intiende?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:779
translate ptbr carlwednesday_308b1386:

    # "Honestly, Leo might not have understood. He'd only been here less than a year."
    "Honestamente, o Leo pode não ter entendido. Ele tava aqui há menos de um ano."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:780
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a716989e:

    # "Still, Leo doesn't say anything, his jaw working and I wonder if he's imagining chewing on Clint's neck."
    "Ainda assim, o Leo não diz nada, com o maxilar trabalhando e eu me pergunto se ele tá imaginando mastigar o pescoço do Clint."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:781
translate ptbr carlwednesday_33ed48f9:

    # cl "\"You're fucking crazy. Let's go, Jeremy.\""
    cl "\"Você é maluco pra caralho. Vamo, Jeremy.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:782
translate ptbr carlwednesday_251323b5:

    # "Clint is afraid of Leo, and he'd left us alone ever since the wolf had moved in, at least for the most part."
    "O Clint tem medo do Leo, e ele tinha deixado a gente em paz desde que o lobo tinha se mudado, pelo menos na maior parte das vezes."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:783
translate ptbr carlwednesday_818d4a31:

    # "Even though they're both thirteen Leo is a head taller and almost twice as wide."
    "Mesmo que os dois tenham treze anos, o Leo é uma cabeça mais alto e quase duas vezes mais largo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:784
translate ptbr carlwednesday_978f759d:

    # l "\"Leave them alone...\""
    l "\"Deixe eles em paz...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:785
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f78447d8:

    # "Clint stops."
    "O Clint para."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:786
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a3e181a7:

    # "Clint" "\"What?\""
    "Clint" "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:787
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e04a676e:

    # l "\"Leave them alone.. forever.\""
    l "\"Deixe eles em paz... pra sempre.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:788
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b39a8cf7:

    # "Clint looks hesitant, obviously not wanting to stay, but unable to leave now that Leo had thrown out a challenge, not in front of Jeremy."
    "O Clint parece hesitar, obviamente não querendo ficar, mas incapaz de ir embora agora que o Leo tinha lançado um desafio, não na frente do Jeremy."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:789
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b33380a:

    # cl "\"Or what?\""
    cl "\"Ou o quê?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:790
translate ptbr carlwednesday_aadb2cf7:

    # l "\"Or...\""
    l "\"Ou...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:791
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3f3157eb:

    # "He thinks for a second."
    "Ele pensa por um segundo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:792
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f5b40ca2:

    # l "\"Is not good for you.. painful.\""
    l "\"Não é bueno pra você... doloroso.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:793
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a22fbae0:

    # "I hadn't been paying attention to Jeremy, but I see a sudden movement from behind Leo followed by another smack and a splash."
    "Eu não tava prestando atenção no Jeremy, mas vejo um movimento repentino por trás do Leo, seguido por outro estalo e um respingo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:797
translate ptbr carlwednesday_fd0b1616:

    # "Leo arches his back, hissing at the pain from how hard Jeremy had thrown it."
    "O Leo arqueia as costas, sibilando de dor pela força com que o Jeremy tinha jogado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:798
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f5c226bf:

    # "The wolf whirls around, one paw rubbing at his back as he snarls at Jeremy who points and laughs."
    "O lobo se vira rapidamente, esfregando uma pata nas costas enquanto rosna pro Jeremy, que aponta e ri."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:799
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e2ade9e6:

    # jer "\"Hah! Wetback!\""
    jer "\"Hah! Cucaracho!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:800
translate ptbr carlwednesday_32a623f1:

    # "He doesn't see Clint running at him from behind."
    "Ele não vê o Clint correndo na direção dele por trás."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:801
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7aec1da3:

    # m "\"LEO!\""
    m "\"LEO!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:802
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f8113c48:

    # "I yelp out his name, and he does turn around, only to catch a sucker punch right in the stomach."
    "Eu grito o nome dele, e ele se vira, só pra levar um soco surpresa direto no estômago."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:803
translate ptbr carlwednesday_34491032:

    # "I can hear the thud along with all the air going out of him all the way from here. Leo stumbles back and stops with his paws on his knees, gasping."
    "Eu consigo ouvir o baque junto com todo o ar saindo dele daqui de onde tô. O Leo tropeça pra trás e para com as patas nos joelhos, ofegando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:804
translate ptbr carlwednesday_23949a76:

    # "I wince and cover my eyes, only to pull them back down immediately and see Jeremy leaping on Leo from behind and biting his ear."
    "Eu estremeço e cubro os olhos, só pra tirar as mãos imediatamente e ver o Jeremy pulando no Leo por trás e mordendo a orelha dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:805
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b68449c:

    # "Leo screams in pain, but immediately twists and slams his knee into Jeremy's crotch."
    "O Leo grita de dor, mas imediatamente se vira e dá uma joelhada no saco do Jeremy."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:806
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4f754e0f:

    # "Jeremy lets go and lets out his own scream which Leo puts an end to when he grabs the fox and swings him around by the shirt."
    "O Jeremy solta e solta o próprio grito, que o Leo põe fim quando agarra a raposa e o gira pela camisa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:807
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8224e845:

    # "Jeremy's forward momentum is brought to a halt as he slams headfirst into the oak tree. He goes down."
    "O impulso pra frente do Jeremy é interrompido quando ele bate de cabeça no carvalho. Ele cai."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:808
translate ptbr carlwednesday_91c09dbc:

    # "Clint's scared, his eyes wide as he looks from Leo to Jeremy to the front door."
    "O Clint tá com medo, os olhos arregalados enquanto ele olha pro Leo, pro Jeremy e pra porta da frente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:809
translate ptbr carlwednesday_66afbd00:

    # "Leo doesn't give him a chance, though, running forward and hitting him with a tackle that slams them both to the ground."
    "O Leo não dá chance pra ele, no entanto, correndo pra frente e o acertando com um tackle que joga os dois no chão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:811
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8cb25e88:

    # "I think I hear Clint start to beg, but Leo's fists start raining down on his face."
    "Eu acho que ouço o Clint começar a implorar, mas os punhos do Leo começam a chover no rosto dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:812
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bfde5019:

    # "Now all I can hear are crunchy, fleshy thuds as punch after punch hits Clint's face."
    "Agora tudo o que eu consigo ouvir são baques crocantes e carnudos enquanto soco após soco acerta o rosto do Clint."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:813
translate ptbr carlwednesday_bae0b2b6:

    # "And I can hear Leo, too—"
    "E eu consigo ouvir o Leo, também—"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:814
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f1642197:

    # l "\"{i}Quieres pelear!? No me jodas!{/i}\""
    l "\"{i}Quieres pelear!? No me jodas!{/i}\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:815
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4bc1de57:

    # "The sounds Clint makes go from snarling to screaming to gurgling and I cover my ears because it sounds so terrible."
    "Os sons que o Clint faz vão de rosnados a gritos e gorgolejos e eu cubro os ouvidos porque soa tão terrível."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:816
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cea4be8a:

    # "Again, I feel like I should stop this; Leo looks like he's in a trance with how focused he is on hurting Clint."
    "De novo, eu sinto que deveria parar com isso; o Leo parece estar em transe com o quão focado tá em machucar o Clint."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:817
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7fbc8da4:

    # "But again, I'm too terrified."
    "Mas, novamente, eu tô aterrorizado demais."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:818
translate ptbr carlwednesday_64c8a92e:

    # "I run in the direction Carl went. I need to tell him I'm sorry, that I should have helped him somehow, but that I was so scared."
    "Eu corro na direção que o Carl foi. Eu preciso pedir desculpas pra ele, dizer que eu deveria ter ajudado de alguma forma, mas que eu tava com muito medo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:819
translate ptbr carlwednesday_07885176:

    # "Even though this road doesn't lead to his house, I somehow get there."
    "Mesmo que essa rua não leve até a casa dele, de alguma forma eu chego lá."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:821
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9cfd5852:

    # "The sky is red and orange, even though it was noon just a few minutes ago."
    "O céu tá vermelho e laranja, mesmo que fosse meio-dia apenas alguns minutos atrás."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:822
translate ptbr carlwednesday_a8401c3b:

    # "For some reason, Carl's house is bigger, much bigger than it should be."
    "Por alguma razão, a casa do Carl tá maior, muito maior do que deveria ser."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:823
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5dcbb611:

    # "The architecture is pointier, different."
    "A arquitetura é mais pontuda, diferente."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:824
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e1752d88:

    # "I walk around it, slowly, looking for Carl."
    "Eu ando em volta dela, devagar, procurando pelo Carl."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:825
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0474d59b:

    # "Looking down, I see hoof prints. They're too big to be Carl's, but I follow them anyway."
    "Olhando pra baixo, eu vejo marcas de cascos. São grandes demais pra serem do Carl, mas eu as sigo mesmo assim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:826
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3fc4844f:

    # "They lead around the back of the house right up to a wooden set of cellar doors."
    "Elas levam pra parte de trás da casa, direto para um par de portas de madeira de um porão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:827
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2de8359b:

    # "I reach out to them, even though I feel something terrible welling up inside my stomach."
    "Eu estendo a mão pra elas, mesmo sentindo algo terrível borbulhando no meu estômago."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:828
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f488dc19:

    # "I pull on them, but they're stuck, as if welded shut somehow."
    "Eu puxo elas, mas tão emperradas, como se tivessem soldadas de alguma forma."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:829
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f3fbb062:

    # "A window well next to the doors draws my attention, and I get down onto my knees, then on my stomach as I look intently through the window."
    "Um poço de janela ao lado das portas atrai minha atenção, e eu me ajoelho, depois deito de bruços enquanto olho fixamente pela janela."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:830
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c8af075a:

    # "There are little clear spots on the glass, little paw prints breaking through a layer of old dust."
    "Tem pequenos pontos limpos no vidro, pequenas marcas de patas furando uma camada de poeira velha."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:831
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5c642d39:

    # "The paw prints of children."
    "Marcas de patas de crianças."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:832
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ae85a736:

    # "The room is almost pitch black, but the red light behind me illuminates some of the cement ground through the windows."
    "A sala tá quase um breu, mas a luz vermelha atrás de mim ilumina um pouco do chão de cimento pelas janelas."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:833
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b416b935:

    # "Behind the paw prints I see something long and spindly crawl across the ground."
    "Atrás das marcas de pata, eu vejo algo longo e esguio rastejar pelo chão."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:837
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3978ebc1:

    # "I don't know where I am at first as I open my eyes, but the dimmed {i}Lucha Lobo{/i} lamp tells me."
    "Eu não sei onde tô no começo quando abro os olhos, mas a luminária fraca de {i}Lucha Lobo{/i} me diz."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:838
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c337227a:

    # "Laying there for a while, I realize that Carl's no longer on top of me."
    "Deitado ali por um tempo, eu percebo que o Carl não tá mais em cima de mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:839
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5de2ccfa:

    # "My face fur is a little wet and my nose is stuffy."
    "O pelo do meu rosto tá um pouco molhado e meu nariz tá entupido."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:840
translate ptbr carlwednesday_16b1241d:

    # "I look around thinking that Carl probably went back to his bed but he's not there either."
    "Eu olho ao redor pensando que o Carl provavelmente voltou pra cama dele, mas ele também não tá lá."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:841
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d57aa7e8:

    # "He must be getting a drink, or something."
    "Ele deve ter ido beber algo, ou sei lá."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:843
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b22fb5d:

    # "A dull, far off thud makes me open my eyes again."
    "Um baque surdo e distante me faz abrir os olhos de novo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:844
translate ptbr carlwednesday_734401ba:

    # "I listen carefully, starting to worry that the sound came from downstairs."
    "Eu escuto com atenção, começando a me preocupar que o som tenha vindo do andar de baixo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:846
translate ptbr carlwednesday_10e83e2d:

    # "Again, I hear it and it makes me jump this time."
    "De novo, eu escuto e isso me faz pular dessa vez."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:847
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1fd464c9:

    # "Shit. Is it happening again?"
    "Merda. Tá acontecendo de novo?"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:848
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1d2a2932:

    # "I hear a voice, coming from the same area, directly below me. It's a lot more muffled, but I can still tell it's a voice; muttering and cursing."
    "Eu ouço uma voz, vindo da mesma área, diretamente abaixo de mim. Tá muito mais abafada, mas ainda dá pra perceber que é uma voz; murmurando e xingando."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:849
translate ptbr carlwednesday_74dba477_1:

    # m "\"Carl?\""
    m "\"Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:850
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d310eb58:

    # "My voice sounds weak and warbly in the heavy silence of the dark house."
    "Minha voz soa fraca e trêmula no pesado silêncio da casa escura."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:851
translate ptbr carlwednesday_169d3002:

    # "The scuffling sounds below me stop for a second, though, then start up again, more vigorous now."
    "Os sons de embaralhamento abaixo de mim param por um segundo, no entanto, depois recomeçam, mais vigorosos agora."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:852
translate ptbr carlwednesday_09643cf9:

    # "Slowly, I sit up, listening to the whispering and thumping beneath me."
    "Lentamente, eu me sento, ouvindo os sussurros e baques abaixo de mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:853
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9f8b56fc:

    # "My mind flashes to Duke, the weasel's foot forward, his eyes locked on me."
    "Minha mente vai pro Duke, o pé da doninha pra frente, os olhos dele cravados em mim."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:854
translate ptbr carlwednesday_18920f1f:

    # "Finally, the anxiety gets to me and I stand up, walking as quietly as I can from the room into the hallway."
    "Finalmente, a ansiedade me domina e eu me levanto, andando o mais silenciosamente que posso do quarto pro corredor."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:856
translate ptbr carlwednesday_e6b2874e:

    # "The kitchen is dark and I move over to the front door to check and see if it's locked."
    "A cozinha tá escura e eu vou até a porta da frente pra verificar se tá trancada."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:857
translate ptbr carlwednesday_dcc32e1d:

    # "It is, so I move over to the stairs and look down into the inky blackness, almost afraid to turn on the lights."
    "Tá sim, então vou até a escada e olho pra baixo na escuridão de tinta, quase com medo de acender as luzes."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:858
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0c275121:

    # "Nothing jumps out at me when I do, but the light is actually making me more afraid knowing that it will light up anything that's down there."
    "Nada pula em mim quando eu acendo, mas a luz na verdade tá me dando mais medo, sabendo que vai iluminar qualquer coisa que esteja lá embaixo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:859
translate ptbr carlwednesday_deeabfe9:

    # "I move down the stairs as quietly as I can, every creak making my fur bristle."
    "Eu desço as escadas o mais silenciosamente que posso, cada rangido fazendo meus pelos se arrepiarem."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:861
translate ptbr carlwednesday_90c5fb0f:

    # "The scraping sound is louder, now, and so is the voice."
    "O som de arranhado tá mais alto, agora, e a voz também."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:862
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2cbd94a9:

    # "I'm almost positive that it's Carl, but I can't be sure. I call out his name again, but it's almost a whisper in my throat."
    "Eu tenho quase certeza que é o Carl, mas não posso ter certeza. Eu chamo o nome dele de novo, mas é quase um sussurro na minha garganta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:863
translate ptbr carlwednesday_790b2167:

    # "I clasp my paws together against my chest, eyes flicking to each doorway as I slowly move down the hall, not wanting Carl to get the jump on me."
    "Eu aperto minhas patas contra o peito, os olhos correndo para cada entrada de porta enquanto eu me movo lentamente pelo corredor, não querendo que o Carl me pegue de surpresa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:866
translate ptbr carlwednesday_7b977f7c:

    # "When I finally get to the crawlspace door, I can pick up a rhythmic thumping along with the scrapes and the muttering is much clearer now."
    "Quando eu finalmente chego na porta do porãozinho, consigo captar uma batida rítmica junto com os arranhões e a murmuração tá muito mais clara agora."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:867
translate ptbr carlwednesday_48ec3027:

    # "???" "\"Buried...inside...help...\""
    "???" "\"Enterrado...dentro...socorro...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:868
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d0845102:

    # "I shiver."
    "Eu me arrepio."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:869
translate ptbr carlwednesday_28a0052b:

    # m "\"Carl, this isn't funny!\""
    m "\"Carl, isso não tem graça!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:870
translate ptbr carlwednesday_4b1adce8:

    # "Again, my voice is weak and unconvincing; he probably didn't even hear me."
    "Mais uma vez, minha voz soa fraca e pouco convincente; ele provavelmente nem me ouviu."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:872
translate ptbr carlwednesday_90a6af48:

    # "Another thump almost shakes the house and I jump."
    "Outro baque quase faz a casa tremer e eu dou um pulo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:873
translate ptbr carlwednesday_f6a256c2:

    # "What the hell is he doing? Is it even Carl? Did whoever is down there murder him and is now in the process of burying his body?"
    "Que porra que ele tá fazendo? Será que é mesmo o Carl? Será que quem quer que esteja lá embaixo o assassinou e agora tá no processo de enterrar o corpo dele?"

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:874
translate ptbr carlwednesday_ef79dfa8:

    # "The fear is too much and I know I have to open the door now and put an end to this stupid prank or I'm gonna call 911 and make everything worse."
    "O medo é demais e eu sei que tenho que abrir a porta agora e acabar com essa brincadeira idiota ou eu vou ligar pro 190 e piorar tudo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:875
translate ptbr carlwednesday_cc3bed8e:

    # "With each step I take towards the doors it feels like the air gets more electrified, the charge making my fur stand on end all over my body."
    "A cada passo que dou em direção às portas, parece que o ar fica mais eletrificado, a carga fazendo meus pelos se arrepiarem por todo o corpo."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:876
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2199b53b:

    # "As soon as I touch the tiny knob to the door and start to pull it open, though, the sound stops."
    "Mas, assim que eu toco na pequena maçaneta da porta e começo a puxá-la, o som para."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:877
translate ptbr carlwednesday_31b5eba4:

    # "I freeze, listening hard. I get the feeling that whatever is down there is doing the exact same thing."
    "Eu congelo, ouvindo atentamente. Eu tenho a sensação de que o que quer que esteja lá embaixo tá fazendo exatamente a mesma coisa."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:878
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0593c91d:

    # "Then I hear a series of thuds as whatever it is runs at the door."
    "Então eu escuto uma série de baques enquanto seja lá o que for corre na direção da porta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:879
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6f0a204b:

    # "I fall back and can't help myself from shrieking, landing on my ass and scooting backwards with my paws and feet."
    "Eu caio pra trás e não consigo me conter de gritar, caindo de bunda e me arrastando pra trás com minhas patas e pés."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:882
translate ptbr carlwednesday_0c602fbb:

    # "The door flies open and I'm face to face with a dusty Carl."
    "A porta se abre com tudo e eu fico cara a cara com um Carl empoeirado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:883
translate ptbr carlwednesday_c3976392:

    # m "\"Carl, what the FUCK!\""
    m "\"Carl, mas que PORRA!\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:884
translate ptbr carlwednesday_8c33b40a:

    # "I scream at him my chest heaving as I clutch it, like I'm about to have a heart attack."
    "Eu grito com ele, meu peito arfando enquanto eu o seguro, como se eu fosse ter um ataque cardíaco."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:885
translate ptbr carlwednesday_09dc6215:

    # "He looks confused, looking around, then back at me, breathing hard himself."
    "Ele parece confuso, olhando ao redor, depois de volta pra mim, respirando fundo também."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:886
translate ptbr carlwednesday_9674da57:

    # c "\"Just, uh...I was just...\""
    c "\"Só, hum... eu só tava...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:887
translate ptbr carlwednesday_d5940b07:

    # "I wait, but he doesn't say anything."
    "Eu espero, mas ele não diz nada."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:888
translate ptbr carlwednesday_26b9b23f:

    # "There's white dust all over his horns and on his shoulders."
    "Tem poeira branca por todos os chifres e nos ombros dele."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:889
translate ptbr carlwednesday_50ef2426:

    # m "\"Just WHAT!?\""
    m "\"Só O QUÊ!?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:890
translate ptbr carlwednesday_5868d2d3:

    # "I yell at him again and he jumps. I'd feel bad if I wasn't so freaked out."
    "Eu grito com ele de novo e ele pula. Eu me sentiria mal se não estivesse tão assustado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:891
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1823632f:

    # c "\"I sleep walk...sometimes, okay?\""
    c "\"Eu sou sonâmbulo... às vezes, ok?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:892
translate ptbr carlwednesday_725aa6a3:

    # "I debate whether or not to accept that as an answer, but he looks confused enough that it just might be true."
    "Eu debato comigo mesmo se aceito ou não isso como resposta, mas ele parece confuso o suficiente pra que isso possa ser verdade."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:893
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3abf6ebc:

    # m "\"You scared the shit out of me.\""
    m "\"Você me cagou de susto.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:895
translate ptbr carlwednesday_3e49a84f:

    # "Carl moves out of the crawlspace, leaning over to brush his head off."
    "O Carl sai do porãozinho, se inclinando pra espanar a cabeça."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:896
translate ptbr carlwednesday_33258a36:

    # c "\"You scared the shit out of ME. I didn't know where I was...\""
    c "\"VOCÊ me cagou de susto. Eu não sabia onde eu tava...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:897
translate ptbr carlwednesday_54b04495:

    # "I slowly get to my feet, still breathing heavily."
    "Eu me levanto devagar, ainda respirando pesado."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:898
translate ptbr carlwednesday_6e67d3d3:

    # m "\"What is that stuff? What were you doing in there?\""
    m "\"O que é isso? O que você tava fazendo aí dentro?\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:899
translate ptbr carlwednesday_1091b912:

    # c "\"Just dust. It's dirty down there.\""
    c "\"Só poeira. É sujo lá embaixo.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:900
translate ptbr carlwednesday_133eef74:

    # "Again, I feel like he's leaving stuff out. I try to look past him into the crawlspace, but he closes the door."
    "De novo, sinto que ele tá escondendo coisas. Tento olhar além dele pro porãozinho, mas ele fecha a porta."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:901
translate ptbr carlwednesday_2db3fca7:

    # c "\"Come on, I need a smoke after that...\""
    c "\"Vamos lá, eu preciso fumar depois dessa...\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:902
translate ptbr carlwednesday_da724c14:

    # "I stand back to let him pass, tempted to open the door again. He grabs my arm when he sees me looking, though."
    "Eu recuo pra deixá-lo passar, tentado a abrir a porta de novo. Ele agarra meu braço quando me vê olhando, no entanto."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:903
translate ptbr carlwednesday_87a8d3df:

    # c "\"Seriously dude, let's go. I don't really wanna be alone in this house right now...please.\""
    c "\"Sério, cara, vamos embora. Eu não quero ficar sozinho nessa casa agora... por favor.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:904
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b6c96757:

    # "I look at him and I can tell he's definitely freaked out. I would be too if I woke up in that crawlspace."
    "Eu olho pra ele e posso perceber que ele tá definitivamente assustado. Eu também estaria se acordasse naquele porãozinho."

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:905
translate ptbr carlwednesday_b5921042:

    # m "\"Yeah, let's go.\""
    m "\"Beleza, vamos.\""

# game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:906
translate ptbr carlwednesday_83bd606d:

    # "Slowly, I follow him, looking back at the door before flicking off the light."
    "Lentamente, eu sigo ele, olhando pra trás pra porta antes de apagar a luz."

translate ptbr strings:

    # game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:618
    old "Is different."
    new "É diferente."

    # game/Carl-Wednesday.rpy:618
    old "Is drunk. I shouldn't let him."
    new "Tá bêbado. Eu não deveria deixar ele."

